#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Upustva"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/apps/cervisia/\">&cervisia;</ulink> is a "
#| "user friendly version control system front-end. The aim is to support "
#| "&CVS; and other version control system programs in a unified interface, "
#| "featuring conflict resolution, difference and history viewers, status for "
#| "the working copy files, and support for most version control functions. "
#| "You can get &cervisia; by building the kdesdk module or installing the "
#| "kdesdk package provided by your distribution. Currently, only &CVS; is "
#| "supported, but other version control systems may be integrated in the "
#| "future."
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"https://www.kde.org/applications/development/cervisia/"
"\">&cervisia;</ulink> is a user friendly version control system front-end. "
"The aim is to support &CVS; in a unified interface, featuring conflict "
"resolution, difference and history viewers, status for the working copy "
"files, and support for most version control functions. You can get "
"&cervisia; by building the <ulink url=\"https://commits.kde.org/cervisia"
"\">&cervisia;</ulink> program or installing the &cervisia; package provided "
"by your distribution."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/apps/cervisia/\">&cervisia;</ulink>je "
"prijateljski sustav kontrole verzija front-end. Cilj je da se podrži &CVS; i "
"druge verzije kontrole sistema programa jedinstvenog sučeljenja, rješavanje "
"sukoba, različite i historijske verzije, status za posao i kopiranje "
"fajlova, i podrška za većinu kontrolnih funkcija. Možete dobiti &cervisia; "
"gradeći kdesdk modul ili instalacija kdesdk paket koji nudi distribuciju. "
"Trenutno, samo  &CVS; je podržan, ali druge kontrole će možda uskoro biti "
"integrisano u budućnosti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A version control system is a tool to record, manage, and distribute "
"different versions of files. &CVS; is a version control system. It allows "
"you to share your modifications easily, as each of the contributors can work "
"on their local copy at the same time, without fear of overwriting each "
"others' modifications. It allows the recovery of past versions (useful for "
"tracking bugs), the creation of branches (for experimental development or "
"for releases of code) and more."
msgstr ""
"Verzijski kontrolni sistem je alat za snimanje, upravljanje, u distribuciju "
"različitih verzija fajlova &CVS; je verzija kontrolnog sistema.  To vam "
"dozvoljava da dijelite svoju modifikaciju lako, kao što svaki saradnik može "
"da radi na istoj kopiji u isto vrijeme, bez straha da ćete pisati jedan "
"preko drugog modifikacije. Dozvoljava povrat prethodne verzije (korisno za "
"praćenje bugova), kracije grana (za eksperimentalno razvijanje koda) i više."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The main <firstterm>repository</firstterm> usually holds a collaborative "
"project (commercial or not), but you can take advantage of the nice revision "
"control features offered by &CVS; even for a project developed exclusively "
"by you. It is easy to set up a local repository, and you will gain the "
"ability to track changes that caused bugs, revert changes, avoid accidental "
"loss of information, &etc;"
msgstr ""
"Glavin <firstterm>skladište</firstterm>uobičajno podržava kolaborativne "
"projekte  (komercijalno ili ne) ali možete uzeti prednost iz revizije "
"kontrole značajke koje se nude u &CVS; i za razvoj projekta ekskluzivno od "
"vas. Jednostavno je postaviti lokalno skladište, i dobit ćete mogućnost "
"pračenja bugova, vratiti promjene, izbječi slučajne gubitke podataka &etc;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The repository holds the project files, and every contributor keeps their "
#| "own local copy, named <firstterm>working copy</firstterm> or "
#| "<firstterm>sandbox</firstterm>; one can then add their modifications to "
#| "the main repository (a process called &quot;committing&quot;) and/or "
#| "update their own copy to reflect recent changes made by other "
#| "contributors."
msgid ""
"The repository holds the project files, and every contributor keeps their "
"own local copy, named <firstterm>working copy</firstterm> or "
"<firstterm>sandbox</firstterm>; one can then add their modifications to the "
"main repository (a process called <quote>committing</quote>) and/or update "
"their own copy to reflect recent changes made by other contributors."
msgstr ""
"Skladište čuva fajlove projekta, i svaki kontributor sačuva svoju kopiju, "
"imenovanu <firstterm> radna kopija </firstterm> ili <firstterm>pješčana "
"kutija</firstterm>; svako može dodati svoje modifikacije u glavno skladište "
"(naziv procesa &quot;committing&quot;) i/ili update njihovu kopiju koja "
"reflektuje prethodne promjene koje su urađene od drugog kontributora."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Prvi Koraci"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accessing The Repository"
msgstr "Pristup Skladištu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this section, we show how to use the basic version control system "
"functionality using &cervisia; to checkout modules from the repository and "
"work with them. To do that, you must have access to the repository as a "
"client, meaning that someone (probably the administrator of the &CVS; "
"repository) gave you an account on the server machine. Alternatively, you "
"can easily create a local repository for your own project."
msgstr ""
"U ovoj sekciji, pokazujemo kako koristiti osnovne kontrole funkcionalnog "
"sistema koristeći &cervisia; da preuzmete module iz skladišta i rad na "
"njima. Da biste učinili to, morate imati pristup skladištu kao klijent, to "
"znači da neko (vjerovatno administrator od  &CVS;  skaldišta) dao vam račun "
"na serveru. Alternativno, možete lahko kreirati lokalno skladište za vaš "
"projekat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you plan to develop a complex project, it is a good idea to use the &CVS; "
"features, even if you are the only developer. You can make all changes in "
"the working copy, and use &cervisia; (or any other &CVS; tool) to update and "
"commit. This way, you will gain the ability to track changes that caused "
"bugs, revert changes, avoid accidental loss of information, &etc; Using "
"&cervisia;, it is simple to create a local repository."
msgstr ""
"Ako planirate da razvijate kompleksan projetk, dobra ideja je da koristite "
"&CVS; karakteristike, iako ste jedini razvijač. Možete napraviti sve "
"promjene u radnoj kopiji, i koristiti &cervisia; (ili bilo koji drugi &CVS; "
"alat) za update i učiniti. Na ovaj način, dobit ćete mogučnosti pračenja "
"promjena radi bugova, vratiti promjene, izbjegavati slučajni gubitak "
"informacija , &etc; Koristeći &cervisia;, to je jednostavno uraditi u "
"lokalnom sladištu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a Local Repository"
msgstr "Kreiranje Lokalnog Skladišta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the <guilabel>Create New Repository (cvs init)</guilabel> dialog by "
"choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>Repository</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Create...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Otvori <guilabel> Kreiraj Novo Skladište (cvs init)</guilabel> biranje "
"dijaloga <menuchoice><guimenu> Skladište </guimenu> <guimenuitem> Kreiraj..."
"</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the <guilabel>...</guilabel> button to select the folder where you "
"want to create the repository, or enter its location in the text box. For "
"instance, if you want to place the repository in the <filename>/home/user</"
"filename> folder, and to name it <filename>cvsroot</filename>, you should "
"type <filename>/home/user/cvsroot</filename> in the text box, or select the "
"<filename>/home/user</filename> folder using the file picker, and add "
"<filename>cvsroot</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite <guilabel>...</guilabel>dugme da biste selektovali folder gdje "
"želite da napravite skladište, ili unestite lokaciju u prostor za tekst. Na "
"primjer, ako želite da smjestite škladište u <filename>/home/user</"
"filename>folder, i imenovatti to <filename>cvsroot</filename>, trebali bi "
"tipkati  <filename>/home/user/cvsroot</filename> u prostor za tekst, ilil "
"selektujte <filename>/home/user</filename> folder koristeći birać fajlova, i "
"dodati <filename>cvsroot</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Confirm by pressing the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button. &cervisia; will "
"create and initialize the new repository folder."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdite pritiskanjem <guibutton>OK</guibutton> dugmeta.&cervisia; će "
"kreirati i incijalizovati novi skladištni folder."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you can import your current work to the repository, or simply create a "
"folder in the repository to start a new module from scratch."
msgstr ""
"Sada možete uvesti svoj trenutni posao u skladište, ili jednostavno kreirati "
"folder u skladištenju i početi novi modul od nule."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cervisia; offers an integrated front-end to manage all your repository "
"locations, the <guilabel>Configure Access to Repositories</guilabel> dialog. "
"To display it, select the <menuchoice><guimenu>Repository</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Repositories...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item."
msgstr ""
"&cervisia; nudi integrirani front-end da upravljate svojim skaldištnim "
"lokacijama <guilabel>Konfiguracija Pristupa u Skladišni</guilabel>dijalog. "
"Da bi ga prikazali, selektujte <menuchoice><guimenu>Skladište</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Skladištenje...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> stavka izbornika."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s Configure Access to Repositories dialog</"
"title>"
msgstr ""
"<title>Slika ekrana &cervisia;'s Konfiguracija Pristupa u Skladišni Dijalog</"
"title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s Configure Access to Repositories "
"dialog</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>Slika ekrana of &cervisia;'s Konfiguracija Pristupa u Skladišni "
"Dijalog</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are several methods to access a &CVS; repository. It may be reached "
"via password authentication (:pserver:), secure shell (using :ext:), local "
"repository (:local:), &etc; The format for the repository location is "
"(optional items appear between square brackets):"
msgstr ""
"Postoji više metoda pristupa u &CVS; skladište. Može mu se pristupiti preko "
"pasvord autentifikacije(:pserver:), osigurani prostor (using :ext:), lokalno "
"skladište  (:local:), &etc; format za lokalno skladište je  (opcionalne "
"stavke se pojavljuju između zagrada):"

#. Tag: filename
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "[:method:][[user][:password]@]hostname[:[port]]/path/to/repository"
msgstr "[:method:][[user][:password]@]hostname[:[port]]/path/to/repository"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Not all these items (user, password, hostname, port) are always necessary to "
"access the repository. The required information depends on the access method "
"used, which can be categorized as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Nisu sve ove stavke (korisnik,pasvord,ime korisnika,otvor) uvijek potrebne "
"za ulazak u skladište. Koje informacije su potrebne zavisi od pristupnog "
"načina, koji može biti kategorizovan kao slijedeće:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "Local"
msgstr "Lokalno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The local access method is the default method used by &CVS;. Therefore, it "
"is optional to add the :local: method to the repository location: you can "
"enter simply the path to the folder which stores the &CVS; repository, and "
"is accessible from your computer, like <filename class=\"directory\">/path/"
"to/repository</filename> or to give a real life example, <filename class="
"\"directory\">/home/cvs</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Lokalni pristupni način je default način određen od &CVS;.Zbog tog, opcijski "
"je dodati:lokalno: metodu skladištenja lokacije:možete jednostvno unijeti "
"put do foldera koji ste spasili &CVS; skladište, i dostupno je s vašeg "
"računara, kao <filename class=\"directory\">/path/to/repository</filename> "
"ili da date životni primjer, <filename class=\"directory\">/home/cvs</"
"filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It may physically be on a disk which is mounted via <acronym>NFS</acronym>, "
"but this is an irrelevant detail. If you created a local repository, the "
"location will be simple the path to it."
msgstr ""
"Može biti fizički na disku koji se montira preko <acronym>NFS</acronym>, ali "
"ovo je nebitan detalj. Ako ste kreirali lokalno skladište, imat ćete "
"jednostavan put do."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "&rsh;"
msgstr "&rsh;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The repository location is something like <filename>:ext:username@host.url."
"org:/path/to/repository</filename>."
msgstr ""
"The repository location is something like <filename>:ext:username@host.url."
"org:/path/to/repository</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This method requires that you have a user account on the server machine (in "
"this example, <systemitem class=\"systemname\">host.url.org</systemitem>) "
"and use a remote shell for communication. By default, &CVS; uses &rsh; for "
"this purpose; however, &rsh; has long considered to be insecure, and is "
"widely replaced by &ssh;."
msgstr ""
"Ova metoda zahtjeva da imate korisnički račun na serveru mašine  (u ovom "
"primjeru, <systemitem class=\"systemname\">host.url.org</systemitem>) i "
"korištenje daljinskog upravljača za komunikaciju.Po redu, &CVS;koristi &rsh;"
"za ovu upotrebu; kako god, &rsh; smatra se nesigurnom,i zamijenjen je sa "
"&ssh;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you wish to use &ssh;, you must set the environment variable "
"$<envar>CVS_RSH</envar> to &ssh; when using the <command>cvs</command> "
"client. &cervisia; supports this easily."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da koristite &ssh;, morate postaviti varijablu okruženja  "
"$<envar>CVS_RSH</envar> to &ssh; kad koristite <command>cvs</command> "
"client. &cervisia; podržava ovo lakše."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that &cervisia; cannot answer possible password requests from the "
"server machine. You must make sure that a remote login works without "
"requiring you to enter the password. With plain vanilla &rsh;, this can be "
"achieved for example by creating a <filename>.rhosts</filename> file in your "
"home folder with a list of trusted hosts (see the &rsh; manpage)."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da &cervisia; ne može odgovoriti na mogućnosti pasvord "
"zahtjeva od mašine. Morate biti sigurni da ulazak preko daljinskog radi bez "
"traženja pasvorda. With plain vanilla &rsh;, ovo možete uspjeti na primjer "
"za kreiranje <filename>.rhosts</filename> fajla u vašem home folderu sa "
"listom povjerljivih gostiju (pogledati &rsh; manpage)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "With &ssh;, it can be achieved by copying your public key located in the "
#| "file <filename>identity.pub</filename>, located in the <filename>"
#| "$<envar>HOME</envar>/.ssh/</filename> folder to the server. In this case, "
#| "the key must not be encrypted with a passphrase (see the &ssh; manpage "
#| "and the &CVS;/<acronym>SSH</acronym> <acronym>FAQ</acronym> on "
#| "SourceForge). If you are unsure about these issues, ask your system "
#| "administrator."
msgid ""
"With &ssh;, it can be achieved by copying your public key located in the "
"file <filename>identity.pub</filename>, located in the <filename>"
"$<envar>HOME</envar>/.ssh/</filename> folder to the server. In this case, "
"the key must not be encrypted with a passphrase, see the &ssh; manpage."
msgstr ""
"Sa &ssh;, može se postići sa kopiranjem vašeg javnog ključa lociranog u "
"fajlu <filename>identity.pub</filename>, locirano u  <filename>$<envar>HOME</"
"envar>/.ssh/</filename> folder za server.U ovom slučaju,ključ ne mora biti "
"šifrovan sa frazama (pogledati &ssh; manpage i &CVS;/<acronym>SSH</acronym> "
"<acronym>FAQ</acronym> on SourceForge). Ako ste nesigurni oko ovih pitanja, "
"pitajte svog sistemskog administratora."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "pserver"
msgstr "pserver"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The repository location looks like <filename>:pserver:username@host.url.org:/"
"path/to/repository</filename>"
msgstr ""
"Lokacija skladišta izgleda kao <filename>:pserver:username@host.url.org:/"
"path/to/repository</filename>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This method accesses the server via a special protocol with a relatively "
"weak authentication (<literal>pserver</literal> stands for password "
"authentication). Before you can use such a server, you need a username and "
"password given by the &CVS; server administrator, and you have to login. "
"Note that your &CVS; password authentication username does not necessarily "
"match the system's username. Before accessing the &CVS; server, you will "
"need to login."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj metod ulazi na server putem specijalnog protokola sa relativno slabom "
"autentifikacijom (<literal>pserver</literal>podržava pasvord "
"autentifikaciju). Prije nego što možete koristiti takoav server, potrebano "
"vam je korissničko ime i pasvord dato od &CVS; server administratora, i "
"morate se ulogovati. Imajte na umu da &CVS; pasvord autentifikacija "
"korisničkog imena ne mora da se poklapa sa sistemskim korisničkim imenom. "
"Prije pristupa u &CVS; server, morate se ulogovati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open-source projects typically offer Anonymous &CVS; access to their "
"sources. This means you can easily grab the latest sources, modify, and "
"create patches (differences) against the repository without asking for a "
"&CVS; account. As a general rule, Anonymous &CVS; uses password "
"authentication (:pserver:), and is a read-only repository, not allowing you "
"to upload your changes directly."
msgstr ""
"Otvoren-izvor projekta tipična ponuda Anonymous &CVS; pristupa njihovom "
"serveru.  Ovo znači da možete preuzeti zadnji izvor, modifikovati, i "
"kreirati puteve (različitosti) protiv sladištenja bez traženja  &CVS; "
"računa. Kao generalno pravilo, Anonymous &CVS; koristi pasvord "
"autentifikaciju (:pserver:),i on je čitanje-samo skladištenje, ne dozvoljava "
"da stavite svoje izmjene direktno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Knowing the access method and location to the repository, you can add it to "
"&cervisia;'s repositories list:"
msgstr ""
"Znajuči metode pristupa i lokaciju skladišta, možete dodati to u "
"&cervisia;'s skladišne liste:"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a New Repository"
msgstr "Dodavanje Novog Skladišta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the <guilabel>Configure Access to Repositories</guilabel> dialog by "
"choosing the <menuchoice><guimenu>Repository</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Repositories...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Otvori <guilabel>Konfiguracija Pristupa u Skladišta </guilabel> dijalog "
"birajuči <menuchoice><guimenu> Skladištenje </guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Skladišta...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> stavke izbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the <guilabel>Add...</guilabel> button to open the <guilabel>Add "
"Repository</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite <guilabel> Dodaj...</guilabel> dugme da biste otvorili "
"<guilabel>Dodaj Skladišni </guilabel> dijalog."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the repository location in the <guilabel>Repository:</guilabel> text "
"box. &cervisia; will automatically disable the areas of the dialog that are "
"not relevant to the access method you entered."
msgstr ""
"Upišite skladišnu lokacuju u <guilabel> Skladište :</guilabel>prostor za "
"tekst.&cervisia; će automatski isključiti arenu dijaloga koje nisu "
"relevantne metodama za ulazak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are using the ext method to access the repository, enter the remote "
"shell you wish to use (&eg; &ssh;) in the <guilabel>Use remote shell (only "
"for :ext: repositories):</guilabel> text box."
msgstr ""
"Ako koristite ext način za ulazak u skladište, ukucajte daljinsku školjku "
"koju želite koristiti  (&eg; &ssh;) u <guilabel> koristite daljinski (samo "
"za  :ext: skladišta):</guilabel>prostor za tekst."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. You will see the repository you just "
"entered on the repositories list."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite <guibutton>OK</guibutton>.Vidjet ćete skladište u koje ste ušli "
"na listi skladišta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the access method to the repository you just entered is password "
"authentication (pserver), you will need to login before connecting the "
"server. Click the repository on the list to select it, and press the "
"<guilabel>Login...</guilabel> button. Enter your password in the upcoming "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Ako je pasvord autentifikacija metoda za ulazak u skladište u koje ste "
"upravo ušli  (pserver),potrebno je da se ulogujete prije konektovanja na "
"server. Kliknite na željeno skladište na listi skladišta, pritisnite "
"<guilabel> Ulazak....</guilabel>dugme. Ukucajte svoj pasvord."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you successfully enter your password, the <guilabel>Status</guilabel> "
"column entry of the pserver repository will change from <guilabel>Not logged "
"in</guilabel> to <guilabel>Logged in</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste uspješno upisali svoj pasvord  <guilabel>Status</guilabel>kolumna "
"ulaska će se promijeniti iz <guilabel>Niste ulogovani </guilabel> u "
"<guilabel>Ulogovani</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:338
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press <guibutton>OK</guibutton> to apply your modifications, or add another "
"location to the list. &cervisia; will store as many locations as you like."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite <guibutton>OK</guibutton>da biste primijenili svoje modifikacije, "
"ili da dodate drugu lokaciju na listu. &cervisia; će sačuvati onoliko "
"lokacija koliko vi želite."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing a Module Into the Repository"
msgstr "Uvoz Modula u Skladište"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this section, we discuss how you can put a new project into the &CVS; "
"repository. If you just want to work with an existing project which is "
"already in a repository, you may skip this section."
msgstr ""
"U ovom odjeljku, mi diskusujemo kako staviti novi projekat u &CVS; "
"skladište. Ako samo želite da radite na već postojećem projektu koji je već "
"u skladištu, možete preskočiti ovaj odjeljak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are two ways to put a project into the &CVS;:"
msgstr "Postoje dva načina za postavljanje projekt u &CVS;:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Import the files and folders to a new <firstterm>module</firstterm>, using "
"&cervisia;'s import dialog. Modules are the top folders in the &CVS; "
"repository folder tree, and are used to separate and organize the different "
"software projects inside the repository."
msgstr ""
"Uvoz fajlova i foldera u novi <firstterm>modul</firstterm>, koristeći "
"&cervisia;'s uvozni dijalog. Moduli su folderi na vrhu u &CVS; skladišnom "
"folderu, i koriste se odvojeno i organizuju se u različitim softverskim "
"projektima unutar skladišta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create an empty module and add the new files and folders manually. You will "
"have more control, but it will probably take a little more time."
msgstr ""
"Kreiraj prazan modul i dodaj nove fajlove i foldere ručno. Imat ćete više "
"kontrole, ali će vjerovatno uzeti malo više vremena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that &CVS; was initially designed to handle text files. Many "
"features, like revision merging, creating differences in a readable form, "
"&etc; are only performed to text files. This does not mean you cannot use "
"&CVS; to keep binary files, it just means you have to <emphasis>explicitly "
"tell &CVS; if it is a text or binary file</emphasis>. If you declare the "
"wrong file type, you will experience problems with the &CVS; functionality "
"for these files, and they may get corrupted."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da &CVS; je prvo urađen da se upravlja tekst fajlovima. Mnoge "
"značajke, kao revizije spajanja, kreiranje razlika u pisanoj formi iz &etc; "
"jedino su obavljane u tekst fajlovima. Ovo ne znači da ne možete koristiti "
"&CVS; za čuvanje binarnih fajlova, to samo znači da trebate da  "
"<emphasis>eksplicitno kažete &CVS; ako je tekst ili binarni fajl </"
"emphasis>. Ako izjavite da je pogrešan tip fajla, imate će te probleme sa "
"&CVS; funkcionalnošču tih fajlova, i mogu se prekinuti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:390
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Importing a project (as a new module) has some advantages: you will import "
"all files and folders recursively, and the module will automatically be "
"created for you. This makes importing large existing projects to the "
"repository easier. However, there are some disadvantages: you cannot use "
"&cervisia;'s import dialog to add files to existing modules, and you can "
"either import the files as text or binary files. You can work around this "
"limitation by creating a folder with files of only one of the types, or by "
"informing the patterns of the files that should be ignored during the import "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Uvoz projekta (kao novi modul) ima neke prednosti: uvest ćete sve fajlove i "
"foldere rekurzivno, i modul će biti kreiran za vas. Ovo omogućava uvoz "
"postojećih projekata brže u skladište. Kako god,  postoje neki nedostatci: "
"ne možete koristiti &cervisia;'s uvoz dijaloga za dodavanje fajlova u "
"postojeće module, i možete uvoziti fajlove kao tekst ili binarne fajlove. "
"Možete raditi oko limita kreirajući folder sa fajlovima samo sa jednim "
"tipom, ili informisanje puteva fajlova koji trebaju biti uvezeni u toku "
"proces."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:401
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For instance, suppose your project contains text files and some PNG images "
"(binary files) only. You can tell &CVS; to ignore all files with the pattern "
"<filename class=\"extension\">*.png</filename> while importing the other "
"files as text, or you can move the images to a separate folder, and then "
"import the remaining files (as text files). Either way, you will have to "
"<link linkend=\"checkingout\">checkout</link> the newly imported module to a "
"new working copy, copy the missing files and folders to it, <link linkend="
"\"addingfiles\">add</link> and <link linkend=\"committingfiles\">commit</"
"link> them to the repository to complete the import process."
msgstr ""
"Na primjer, predpostavimo da vaš projekt sadrži tekst fajlove i neke PNG "
"slike (binarni fajlovi) samo. Možete reći &CVS; ignoriše sve fajlove sa "
"obrascem <filename class=\"extension\">*.png</filename>  u toku uvoza drugih "
"fajlova kao teksta, ili možete premijestiti slike u odvojeni folder, i onda "
"uvesti preostale fajlove (kao tekstualni fajl). U svakom slučaju, trebat "
"ćete  <link linkend=\"checkingout\">provjera</link> novi uvezeni modul za "
"novu radnu kopiju, kopiranje foldera i fajlova koji nedostaju u to, <link "
"linkend=\"addingfiles\">dodaj</link> i <link linkend=\"committingfiles"
"\">učini</link>njih u skladište za kompletiranje uvoznog procesa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As an alternative, you can add the files and folders manually, creating an "
"empty module for them. To add an empty module to a repository, just create a "
"new folder in the &CVS; repository root folder. The name of this new folder "
"will be the name of the module. <link linkend=\"checkingout\">Checkout</"
"link> the new empty module. Then copy the files and folders to the working "
"copy, <link linkend=\"addingfiles\">add</link> and <link linkend="
"\"committingfiles\">commit</link> to upload them to the &CVS; repository."
msgstr ""
"Kao alternativa, možete dodati fajlove i foldere ručno, kreiranjem praznog "
"modula za njih. Za dodavanje praznog modula u skladište, samo kreirajte novi "
"folder u &CVS; skladišni korijenski folder.  Ime ovog foldera će biti ime "
"modula <link linkend=\"checkingout\">Provjera</link> novi prazni modul. Onda "
"kopirajte fajlove i foldere u radnu kopiju, <link linkend=\"addingfiles"
"\">dodaj</link> and <link linkend=\"committingfiles\">učini</link> za "
"dodavanje njih u &CVS; skladište."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s import dialog</title>"
msgstr "<title>Slika ekrana &cervisia;'s uvozni dijalog</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s import dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Slika ekrana od  &cervisia;'s uvozni dijalog</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In <xref linkend=\"screenshot-import\"/> you can see the dialog which helps "
"you to <emphasis>import</emphasis> a project as a module. To access "
"&cervisia;'s import dialog, choose the <menuchoice><guimenu>Repository</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Import...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item."
msgstr ""
"U <xref linkend=\"screenshot-import\"/> možete vidjeti dijalog koji vam "
"pomaže <emphasis>uvoz</emphasis> projekta kao modula. Da bi pristupili "
"&cervisia;'s  uvoznom dijalogu, birajte <menuchoice><guimenu>Skladište</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem> Uvoz...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>stavka izbornika."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:445 index.docbook:600
#, no-c-format
msgid "Repository:"
msgstr "Skladištenje:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter or select from the drop down box the name of the &CVS; repository, "
"also known as $<envar>CVSROOT</envar>. You must have write access to it, and "
"the repository must be properly initialized. If the repository does not yet "
"exist, you can create one choosing the <menuchoice> <guimenu>Repository</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Create...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Ukucajte ili selektujte padajuću kućicu imena &CVS; skladištenja, također "
"poznato kao $<envar>CVSROOT</envar>. Morate imati pisani pristup tome, i "
"skladište mora biti ispravno inicjalizirana. Ako skladište još uvijek ne "
"postoji, možete kreirati jedno koristeči <menuchoice> <guimenu>Skladište</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Kreiraj...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> stavka "
"izbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:457
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The drop down box shows a list of the repositories you previously entered "
"using the <guilabel>Configure Access to Repositories</guilabel> dialog box. "
"If the repository is remote, make sure that authentication works. See <xref "
"linkend=\"accessing-repository\"/> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Padajuća kućica pokazuje listu skladišta u koje ste prethodno ušli koristeći "
"<guilabel>Konfiguriši Pristup u Skladišni</guilabel> dijalošku kutiju.Ako je "
"skladište daljinski, budite sigurni da autentifikacija radi.Pogledaj <xref "
"linkend=\"accessing-repository\"/> za više informacija."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:467 index.docbook:612
#, no-c-format
msgid "Module:"
msgstr "Moduli:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:468
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The name of the module under which the project will be stored. After the "
"import, the project can be checked out under this name. See <xref linkend="
"\"checkingout\"/> for more information. This is also the name of the "
"corresponding folder in the repository."
msgstr ""
"Ime modula pod kojim će projekat biti sačuvan. Nakon uvoza, projekat može "
"biti provjeren pod njegovim imenom. Pogledaj <xref linkend=\"checkingout\"/> "
"za više informacija. Ovo je također ime od odgovarajućeg foldera u skladištu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:477
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working Folder:"
msgstr "Folder za Rad:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:478
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The toplevel folder of the project you want to import. The import starts "
"from this folder and goes down recursively."
msgstr ""
"Najviši folder projekta koji želite uvesti. Uvoz starta od ovog foldera i "
"ide dolje rekurzivno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:485
#, no-c-format
msgid "Vendor tag:"
msgstr "Etiketa prodavača:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:486
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The vendor tag is historically used for tracking third-party sources. Just "
"use your user name if you have no better idea. It does not matter much what "
"you enter here."
msgstr ""
"Etiketa prodavača se koristi za pračenje historije trečeg izvora. Samo "
"koristite svoje korisničko ime ako nemate bolju ideju. Nije bitno previše "
"što ste ušli ovdje."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:494
#, no-c-format
msgid "Release tag:"
msgstr "Puštanje etikete:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tag is also historically used for importing different versions of third-"
"party software. If you are not doing this, use the word <literal>start</"
"literal> or a string <literal>FOO_1_0</literal> where <literal>FOO</literal> "
"is the name of your project and <literal>1.0</literal> is the version number "
"of the imported release."
msgstr ""
"Ova etiketa se također koristi za uvoz različite treće verzije softvera. Ako "
"ne radite ovo, koristite riječ <literal>start</literal> ili žicu  "
"<literal>FOO_1_0</literal>gdje<literal>FOO</literal> je ime vašeg projekt i  "
"<literal>1.0</literal> je verzija broja koje ste uvezli."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ignore files:"
msgstr "Ignorisanje fajlova:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:506
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you fill out this field, an additional <option>-I <replaceable>file "
"names</replaceable></option> option is given go the <command>cvs import</"
"command> command. This entry is interpreted as a whitespace-separated list "
"of file name patterns which are ignored. In general, a cleaner and less "
"error-prone way to control which files go into the repository is to create a "
"folder with only the files which you want to import and start from that. "
"Nevertheless, this entry may be useful if the project contains files which "
"are by default ignored by &CVS;, &eg; files with the name <filename>core</"
"filename>. In such a case, simply enter the character <literal>!</literal> "
"in this field: this overrules &CVS;'s scheme of ignored files, see <xref "
"linkend=\"ignoredfiles\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ako popunite ovo polje, kao dodatno <option>-I <replaceable>ime fajlova</"
"replaceable></option>opcija je data da <command>cvs import</command>komanda. "
"Ovaj unos tumači se kao razmakom-odvojen popis imena datoteke obrasce koje "
"se ignoriraju. Generalno, čistiji i manje sklon greškama način za kontrolu "
"kojim idu datoteke u spremište je stvoriti folder sa samo datotekama koje "
"želite uvesti i početi od toga. Ipak, ovaj unos može biti koristan ako "
"projekat sadrži fajlove koji su po defaultu ignorisani od &CVS;, &eg;  fajl "
"sa imenom <filename>core</filename>. U takvom slučaju, jednostavno unesite "
"znakove <literal>!</literal>u polje. ovo važi  &CVS;'s šema za ignorisani "
"fajl, pogledaj <xref linkend=\"ignoredfiles\"/>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:521
#, no-c-format
msgid "Comment:"
msgstr "Komentari:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:522
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use this field to record the comments you might have about the origin, use, "
"development, &etc; of the files you are importing."
msgstr ""
"Koristite ovo polje za snimanje komentara koje imate možda oko porijekla, "
"koriščenja, razvijanja  &etc; fajlova koje uvozite."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:529
#, no-c-format
msgid "Import as binaries"
msgstr "Uvezite kao binarne"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:530
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you check this box, all files are imported in binary mode, &ie; an "
"argument <option>-kb</option> is given to <command>cvs import</command>."
msgstr ""
"Ako provjerite ovaj dio, svi fajlovi su uvezeni u binarnom modu &ie; "
"argument <option>-kb</option>je dat u <command>cvs uvoz</command>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:537
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use file's modification as time of import"
msgstr "Koristi modifikaciju fajlova kao vrijeme uvoza"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you check this box, the time of import will be the file's modification "
"time instead of the import time."
msgstr ""
"Ako provjerite ovaj dio, vrijeme uvoza će biti vrijeme modifikacijonog "
"vremena umjesto vremena uvoza."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:547
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you have filled out this form and confirmed by pressing <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>, the following &CVS; command is used:"
msgstr ""
"Kada ste popunili ovu formu i potvrdila pritiskanjem <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>, slijedeće &CVS; komanda je koriščena:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>cvs</command> -d <co id=\"co-repository\"></"
"co><replaceable>repository</replaceable> import -m \"<co id=\"co-comment\"></"
"co>\" <co id=\"co-module\"></co><replaceable>module</replaceable> <co id="
"\"co-vendortag\"></co><replaceable>vendortag</replaceable> <co id=\"co-"
"releasetag\"></co><replaceable>releasetag</replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs</command> -d <co id=\"co-repository\"></"
"co><replaceable>repository</replaceable> import -m \"<co id=\"co-comment\"></"
"co>\" <co id=\"co-module\"></co><replaceable>module</replaceable> <co id="
"\"co-vendortag\"></co><replaceable>vendortag</replaceable> <co id=\"co-"
"releasetag\"></co><replaceable>releasetag</replaceable>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:556
#, no-c-format
msgid "Checkout a Module From the Repository"
msgstr "Provjera Modula iz Skladišta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:557
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now that you successfully defined your repository location, and imported the "
"initial files to the repository, it is time to retrieve the module from the "
"&CVS; repository, creating your working copy."
msgstr ""
"Sada kad ste uspješno definisali lokaciju skladišta, uvezite bitne fajlove u "
"skladište, vrijeme je povratiti modul iz &CVS; skladišta, kreirajući radu "
"kopiju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:563
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should also know the name of the <firstterm>branch</firstterm> or "
"<firstterm>tag</firstterm> you want to use."
msgstr ""
"Trebate također znati ime od <firstterm>branch</firstterm> ili "
"<firstterm>tag</firstterm> koji želite koristiti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:568
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Branches of a module are parallel versions of this module. A good real-"
#| "life example of the use of this feature is the release of a software "
#| "project. After a major release, there are bugs in the code that should be "
#| "fixed, but people want to add new features to the application too. It is "
#| "very hard to do both at the same time because new features usually "
#| "introduce new bugs, making it hard to track down the old ones. To solve "
#| "this dilemma, &CVS; lets you create a parallel version, that we will call "
#| "the &quot;stable release branch&quot;, where you can only add bugfixes, "
#| "leaving the main branch (HEAD) open for adding new features."
msgid ""
"Branches of a module are parallel versions of this module. A good real-life "
"example of the use of this feature is the release of a software project. "
"After a major release, there are bugs in the code that should be fixed, but "
"people want to add new features to the application too. It is very hard to "
"do both at the same time because new features usually introduce new bugs, "
"making it hard to track down the old ones. To solve this dilemma, &CVS; lets "
"you create a parallel version, that we will call the <quote>stable release "
"branch</quote>, where you can only add bugfixes, leaving the main branch "
"(HEAD) open for adding new features."
msgstr "Branches."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:579
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tags are used to mark a version of a project. &CVS; stamps one version of "
"each file with the tag, so when you checkout or update to a specific tag, "
"you will get always the same file versions. Therefore, in opposition to "
"branches, tags are not dynamic: you cannot develop a tag. Tags are useful to "
"mark releases, big changes in the code, &etc; Using tags, you can easily "
"return the project to a previous state, to reproduce and track bugs, "
"generate the release code again, &etc;"
msgstr ""
"Oznake se koriste da se markira verzija projekta.&CVS;  pečati su jedna "
"verzija za svaki fajl sa oznakom, tako da kad provjeravate update za "
"specifičnu oznaku, uvijek ćete dobiti istu verziju fajla. Zbog tog, suprotno "
"od branches, oznake nisu dinamične: ne možete razviti oznaku. Oznake su "
"koriste za realizovanje markiranja, velikih promjena u kodu, &etc;  "
"Korištenjem oznaka, možete lahko da vratite projekat u prethodno stanje, za "
"reproduciranje i pračenja bugova, generaliziranje koda opet, &etc;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:590
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s checkout dialog</title>"
msgstr "<title>Slika ekrana od &cervisia;'s odjavni dijalog </title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:593
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s checkout dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>A slika ekrana od &cervisia;'s provjerite dijalog</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:601
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The name of the &CVS; repository, also known as <filename><envar>$CVSROOT</"
"envar></filename>. The drop down box shows a list of the repositories you "
"previously entered using the <guilabel>Configure Access to Repositories</"
"guilabel> dialog box. If the repository is remote, make sure that "
"authentication works. See <xref linkend=\"accessing-repository\"/> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Ime od &CVS; skladišta, također poznato kao <filename><envar>$CVSROOT</"
"envar></filename>. Padajuća kutija pokazuje listu skladišta u koje ste "
"prethodno ušli koristeći <guilabel>Konfiguracija Pristupa Skladištu </"
"guilabel>dijaloška kutija. Ako je skladište daljinski, potrudite se da "
"autentifikacija radi. Pogledajte <xref linkend=\"accessing-repository\"/> za "
"više informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:613
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The name of the module to be checked out. If you are working with an "
"existing repository, you can probably get this name from the system "
"administrator; or, if it is an open-source repository, you can get the "
"module names from the project web pages. If you want to create a new module "
"from scratch using a local repository, just create a new folder in the local "
"repository root folder. The name of the folder will be the same as the name "
"of the empty module."
msgstr ""
"Ime modula se može provjeriti. Ako radite sa već postojećim skladištem, "
"vjerovatno možete dobiti ovo ime od sistemskog adiministratorom; ili, ako je "
"otvoreno-traženje skladišta, možete dobiti ime modula iz projektne web "
"stranice. Ako želite da kreirate novi modul za korištenje lokalnog "
"skladišta, samo kreirajte novi folder u lokalnom skladištu korijenskom "
"folderu. Ime foldera će biti isto kao i ime preznog modula."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:621
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if the repository has a <filename><envar>$CVSROOT</envar>/"
"modules</filename> file, you can retrieve a list of available modules by "
"pressing the <guibutton>Fetch List</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno, ako skladište ima <filename><envar>$CVSROOT</envar>/modules</"
"filename>fajl, možete povratiti listu modula pritiskanjem  <guibutton>Fetch "
"List</guibutton>dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:627
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Note that it is possible to checkout any existing subfolder of the "
#| "module, without retrieving the rest of the module. Just enter the path to "
#| "the subfolder as well. For instance, if you want to get only the "
#| "<filename class=\"directory\">doc/cervisia</filename> subfolder of the "
#| "kdesdk module, enter <filename class=\"directory\">kdesdk/doc/cervisia</"
#| "filename> in this field."
msgid ""
"Note that it is possible to checkout any existing subfolder of the module, "
"without retrieving the rest of the module. Just enter the path to the "
"subfolder as well."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da je moguća provjera svakog podfoldera u ovom modulu, bez "
"povratna na sve module. Samo uđite u dio podfoldera također. Na primjer, ako "
"želite dobiti samo <filename class=\"directory\">doc/cervisia</"
"filename>podfolder od  kdesdk modula, enter <filename class=\"directory"
"\">kdesdk/doc/cervisia</filename> u ovom polju."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:635
#, no-c-format
msgid "Branch tag:"
msgstr "Branch oznaka:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:636
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The name of the branch or tag you want to check out. If you leave this field "
"empty, &cervisia; will retrieve the main (HEAD) branch."
msgstr ""
"Ime od branch ili oznake koju želite provjeriti. Ako ostavite ovo polje "
"prazno, &cervisia; će povratiti glavno (HEAD) branch."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:643
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working folder:"
msgstr "Radni folder:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:644
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The folder under which the module should be checked out. Note that the "
"working copy toplevel folder is named after the module you are retrieving, "
"unless you give it an alternative name in the <guilabel>Check out as:</"
"guilabel> field."
msgstr ""
"Folder u okviru kojeg modul treba da provjeri. Imajte na umu top level od "
"radne kopije je imenovana po modulu koji skladištite, osim ako mu niste dali "
"alternativno ime u <guilabel>Pregled kao:</guilabel> polje."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:653
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check out as:"
msgstr "Pregled kao:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:654
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This results in the working copy files being checked out to an alternative "
"folder under the working folder rather than a folder named after the module."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj rezultat u radnoj kopiji počinje provjeru alternativnog foldera u "
"okviru radnog foldera radije nego da je folder nazvan po modulu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:661
#, no-c-format
msgid "Export only"
msgstr "Izvoz samo"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:662
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you check this box, the files will be exported rather than checked out. "
"Exporting obtains a copy of the source for the module without the &CVS; "
"administrative folders. For example, export may be used to prepare the "
"source code for a release."
msgstr ""
"Ako provjerite ovu kutiju, fajlovi će biti izvezeni radije nego provjereni. "
"Eksport obuhvata kopiju izvora za modul bez &CVS; administrativni folderi. "
"Na primjer, ekport može biti korišten za pripremu izvora koda za puštanje."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:671
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recursive checkout"
msgstr "Rekurzivna provjera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:672
#, no-c-format
msgid "Checkout all files and folders recursively."
msgstr "Provjerite sve fajlove i foldere rekurzivno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:682
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Main Screen, Viewing File Status and Updating"
msgstr "Glavni Ekran, Pregled Statusa Fajlova i Updating"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:683
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start &cervisia;, and open a working copy by choosing <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open Sandbox...</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice>, you can see two main areas in &cervisia;'s main window: the top "
"one is a hierarchical (tree) view of the current working copy; the bottom "
"area is used to display the &CVS; commands &cervisia; issues to perform its "
"tasks, as well as the output generated by these commands."
msgstr ""
"Kad počnete &cervisia;,i otvorite radnu kopiju birajuči <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Otvorite Piješčanu kutiju....</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, možete vidjeti dvije glavne arene u "
"&cervisia;'sglavni prozor: glavni je postavljen na vrh (hijerarhijski) "
"pregled trenutne radne kopije; donji dio se koristi za prikaz &CVS; komandi "
"&CVS; problemi u ostvarivanju ovog zadatka, izlaz generira komande."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:695
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, &cervisia; does not display the files contained by the sub-"
"folders, so you will have to click the folders you want to see. To display "
"all files of the working copy, select <menuchoice> <guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Unfold File Tree</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. To close back all "
"folders from the working copy, choose <menuchoice> <guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Fold File Tree</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Po redu &cervisia;ne prikazuje fajlove koji sadrže podfoldere, tako da "
"morate da kliknete na foldere koje želite da vidite. Da biste prikazali sve "
"fajlove od radne kopije, selektujte  <menuchoice> <guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Unfold File Tree</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. Da zatvorite sve "
"foldere iz radne kopije,izaberite <menuchoice> <guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Fold File Tree</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:710
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"According to the settings in your <filename>.cvsignore</filename> files, the "
"files you usually do not want to include into the repository - such as "
"object files - are not shown in the tree view. For each file, you see its "
"corresponding status. In the default setting, after opening the sandbox, "
"this is \"Unknown\" because &cervisia; delays the fetching of information "
"until you select the files and folders whose status you want to update or "
"view and choose <menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Update</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> or <menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Status</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. With this approach, you "
"have a minimal amount of functionality available even if you do not have a "
"permanent connection to the &CVS; server."
msgstr ""
"Prema vašim postavkam u vašim<filename>.cvsignore</filename>fajlovima, "
"fajlovi koje inače nećete da uključite u skladište- kao što su objektni "
"fajlovi-nisu pokazani u pregledu. Za svaki fajl, vidite i status koji im "
"odgovara. U default postavkama, poslije otvaranje piješćane kutije, ovo je  "
"\"Unknown\" because &cervisia; odgađa privlačenje informacija dok ne "
"selektujete fajl i folder čiji status hoćete da updete ili pogledati i "
"izabrati  <menuchoice> <guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Update</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> ili <menuchoice> <guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Status</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. Sa pristupom, imate "
"minimalni broj funkcija dostupnih iako nemate stalnu konekciju na &CVS; "
"server."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:732
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s main view</title>"
msgstr "<title>A slika ekrana &cervisia;'s glavni pregled</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:735
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s main view</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>A slika ekrana &cervisia;'s glavni pregled</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:739
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The commands in the File menu usually act only on the files which you have "
"marked. You may also mark folders. Now choose <menuchoice> <guimenu>File</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Status</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> or press "
"<keycap>F5</keycap>. &cervisia; issues a"
msgstr ""
"Komande u Fajl izborniku uobičajno se ponaša samo s fajlovima koje ste "
"markirali. Možete također da markirate foldere. Sad izaberite <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Status</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> ili "
"pritisni  <keycap>F5</keycap>. &cervisia; issues a"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:749
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs update -n <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs update -n <replaceable>nazivi fajlova</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:752
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"command to get status information for the marked files. Note that &cervisia; "
"goes recursively into subfolders only if you have the according option in "
"the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu set. According to the respective file's "
"status, you now see an entry in the <guilabel>Status</guilabel> column:"
msgstr ""
"komanda da dobijete statusnu informaciju markiranog fajla. Imajte na umu da "
"&cervisia; ide rekurzivno u podfoldere jedino ako imate odgovarajuću opciju "
"u  <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> postavke izbornika.Prema statusu odgovarajuće "
"datoteke, sada vidite unos u  <guilabel>Status</guilabel>kolumna:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:762
#, no-c-format
msgid "Locally Modified"
msgstr "Lokalno Modificirano"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:763
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This means you have modified the file compared to the version in the "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"Ovo znači da imate modifikovan fajl koji možete uporediti sa verzijom u "
"skladištu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:771
#, no-c-format
msgid "Locally Added"
msgstr "Lokalno Dodano"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:772
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This means the file does not exist in the repository, but in your working "
"copy and you have scheduled it for addition. The actual insertion into the "
"repository only happens after a commit."
msgstr ""
"Ovo znači da fajl ne postoju u skladištu, ali u vašoj radnoj kopiji i "
"planiran dodatak. Stvari dodatak u skladište dešava se samo kad je sve "
"završeno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:780
#, no-c-format
msgid "Locally Removed"
msgstr "Lokalno Uklonjeno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:781
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This means you have scheduled the file for removal, but it still exists in "
"the repository. The actual removal happens only after a commit."
msgstr ""
"Ovo znači da imate planirano uklanjanje fajlova, ali još uvijek postoji u "
"skladištu. Stvarno uklanjanje se dešava kad se sve završi."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:789
#, no-c-format
msgid "Needs Update"
msgstr "Potrebni Update"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:790
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is shown if a newer version of the file exists in the repository, &eg; "
"because someone committed a modification. Normally, you want to update this "
"file so you have an up-to-date version in your folder."
msgstr ""
"Ovo se prikazuje ako novija verzija fajla postoji u skladištu, &eg; jer je "
"neko uradio modifikaciju. Normalno, vi želite da update ove fajlove tako da "
"imate današnju verziju u vašem folderu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:798
#, no-c-format
msgid "Needs Patch"
msgstr "Potrebna Zakrpa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:799
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is essentially the same as before; the difference is that in case of an "
"update, the &CVS; server transfers only a patch instead of the whole file to "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je ustvari isto kao i prije; razlika je u slučaju kad je update &CVS;, "
"server transferuje samo dio umjesto cijelog fajla."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:807
#, no-c-format
msgid "Needs Merge"
msgstr "Potrebno Spajanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:808
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Indicates that a merge of the revision of this file in your working copy "
"with the version in the repository is necessary. This typically happens if "
"you have made modifications to the file while someone else has committed his "
"modifications. If you choose to update, the modifications in the repository "
"are merged into your file. In case of a conflict (&ie; if someone else has "
"changed some of the same lines like you) the new status is then \"Conflict\"."
msgstr ""
"Indikacija da margina revizije fajla u vašoj radnoj kopiji sa verzijom u "
"skladištu je neophodno.Ovo je tipično dešava ako ste napravili modifikacije "
"u fajlu dok neko drugi radi svoje modifikacije. Ako izaberete update, "
"modifikacija u skladištu su označene u vašem fajlu. U slučaju konflikta  "
"(&ie; ako je neko drugi promijenio neke linije kao vi) onda je novi status "
"\"Conflict\"."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:820
#, no-c-format
msgid "Up to Date"
msgstr "Do danas"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:821
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Indicates that the file is identical with the version in the repository."
msgstr "Indicira da je fajl identičan sa verzijom u skladištu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:828
#, no-c-format
msgid "Conflict"
msgstr "Sukob"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:829
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is shown if this file still has conflict markers in it. Maybe you have "
"previously updated the file and not resolved the conflicts."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je prikazano ako ovaj fajl markiran u tom. Možda imate prethodno update "
"fajl i niste riješili konflikt."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:836
#, no-c-format
msgid "Not In CVS"
msgstr "Nije u CVS"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:837
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Indicates that the file is not registered in the &CVS; repository. If you "
"want it to available for others, you should add it to the repository. If "
"not, you may consider adding it to your <filename>.cvsignore</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"Indicira da taj fajl nije registrova u &CVS; skladištu. Ako želite da je "
"dostupno za druge, trebate dodati to u skladište. Ako ne, možete razmisliti "
"da dodate to u <filename>.cvsignore</filename> fajl."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:847
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now that you have got an overview of the current status of the &CVS;, you "
"may want to do an update. Mark some files (or the root of the folder tree "
"which is equivalent to marking all files in this folder). Now choose "
"<menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Update</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice> (Of course, you could have chosen this at the beginning of the "
"session). For some of the files the status may change now. Typically, files "
"which had \"Needs Patch\" or \"Needs Update\" are updated. So the following "
"new items are possible in the status column:"
msgstr ""
"Sad kad imate pregled trenutnog statusa od  &CVS;,možda ćete željeti "
"update.  Označite neke fajlove (ili korijeni foldera koji je ekvivalentan "
"oznakam svih fajlova u ovom folderu). Sad izaberite <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Update</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> "
"(Naravno, možete ovo izabrati na početku sesije). Za neke fajlove status se "
"može promijeniti sad. Tipično, fajlovi koji imaju  \"Needs Patch\" or "
"\"Needs Update\" su update. Tako da nove stake su moguće u statusnoj kolumni:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:864
#, no-c-format
msgid "Updated"
msgstr "Update"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:865
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shown if the file was updated from the repository."
msgstr "Prikažite ako je fajl update iz skladišta."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:871
#, no-c-format
msgid "Patched"
msgstr "Patched"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:872
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Indicates that the &CVS; server has sent a patch for this file and the patch "
"has been successfully applied. If the patch was not successful because there "
"was a conflict between your modifications and those someone else committed "
"to the repository, the status is now <guilabel>Conflict</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Indicira da &CVS; server je poslao zakrpu za ovaj fajl i zakrpa je "
"aplicirana. Ako zakrpa nije bila uspješna zbog konflikta između vaših "
"modifikacija i onih koje je neku učinio u vašem skladištu, status je sad "
"<guilabel>Konflikt</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:882
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may have noticed that according to the status of the file, its row has a "
"different color. The colors are chosen to somehow reflect the priority of "
"the status. For example, a file with a conflict is marked red to show you "
"that you have to resolve a conflict before you can continue working with the "
"file. If your folder contains a high number of files, you may nevertheless "
"lose the overview. To get more concise information about which files have an "
"unusual status, simply click on the header of the <guilabel>Status</"
"guilabel> column. The file list is then sorted by priority, so you have all "
"important information at the top of the list. To get back to the "
"alphabetically sorted view, click on the header of the <guilabel>File name</"
"guilabel> column."
msgstr ""
"Možda ste primijetili da prema statusu fajla, boja reda ima drugačiju boju. "
"Boje su birane nekako reflektujuči prioritet. Na primjer, fajl sa konfliktom "
"markira crvenom da pokaže da morate da riješite konflikt prije nego što "
"nastavite rad sa ovom fajlom. Ako vaš folder sadrži veliki broj fajlova, "
"možete izgubiti prepis. Da biste dobili više informacija koji fajl ima "
"neobičan status, jednostavno kliknite na <guilabel>Postavke</"
"guilabel>kolumne. Lista fajlova je sortirana po prioritetima, tako da imate "
"sve važne informacije na vrhu. Da biste se vratili na abecedni pregled, "
"kliknite na vrh na  <guilabel>naziv Fajla</guilabel> kolumna."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:901
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working With Files"
msgstr "Rad Sa Fajlovima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:903
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All commonly used &CVS; functionality is directly available in &cervisia;'s "
"main view. Commands usually act on several files at once, namely all which "
"currently selected. If the selection includes folders, its interpretation "
"depends on the settings made under the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu. For "
"example, if <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Commit &amp; "
"Remove Recursively</guimenuitem></menuchoice> is checked and you choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Commit...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> while a folder is selected, then all files in the tree under "
"that folder are committed. Otherwise, only the regular files in the folder "
"itself are affected."
msgstr ""
"Obično korištene &CVS; funkcionalno je direktno dostupno u  &cervisia;'s "
"pregledu izbornika. Komande uobičajno reaguju na više fajlova od jednom, "
"većinom odmah one koji su selektovane. Ako selekcija uključuje foldere, "
"interpretacija zavisi od postavki koje ste postavili <guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu> izbornik. Na primjer, ako <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Commit &amp; Remove Recursively</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> je provjereno i vi birate <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Učiniti...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> dok je folder "
"selektovan, onda svi fajlovi u folderu su učinjeni. U drugom slučaju,jedino "
"regularni fajlovi u folderu su pogođeni."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:917
#, no-c-format
msgid "A screenshot of &cervisia;'s context menu"
msgstr "A slika ekrana &cervisia;'s  kontekstni izbornik"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:923
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The most used actions are also available by right clicking the files in the "
"tree view, through the context menu. <xref linkend=\"screenshot-popup\"/> "
"shows &cervisia;'s main window context menu."
msgstr ""
"Najuobičajnije akcije su također dostupne kad kliknete desnom tipkom na "
"pregled, kroz kontekstni izbornik. <xref linkend=\"screenshot-popup\"/> "
"shows &cervisia;'s glavni prozor kontekstni izbornik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:929
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can simply edit a file by double-clicking on it or selecting it and "
"pressing &Enter;. This starts the default application that handles that file "
"type (the default application for each file type is a &kde; wide setting). "
"If the default application is not the one you want to use, you can right "
"click the file and choose the <menuchoice> <guisubmenu>Edit With</"
"guisubmenu> </menuchoice> submenu, and select one of the other applications "
"that handle that file type."
msgstr ""
"Možete jednostavno urediti fajl duplim klikom na selektovani fajl i "
"pritiskanjem &Enter;. Ovo pokreče default aplikaciju koji rukuje sa tipom "
"fajla (default aplikacija za svaki tip fajla je &kde; široko podešavanje). U "
"default aplikaciju nije ona koju želite da koristite, možete desnim klikom "
"da izaberete fajl <menuchoice> <guisubmenu>Uredi Sa</guisubmenu> </"
"menuchoice>podizbornik, i selektuj aplikaciju koja će upravljati s tim tipom "
"fajla."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:942
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Files"
msgstr "Dodavanje Fajlova"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:944
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adding files to a project requires two steps: first, the files must be "
"registered with &CVS;, or in other words, <emphasis>added to the repository</"
"emphasis>. This is necessary, but not sufficient. In order to actually put "
"the files into the repository, you must <emphasis>commit</emphasis> them. "
"This procedure has an important advantage: you can commit the files together "
"with modifications to other parts of the project. When doing this, one can "
"easily see (&eg; in commit emails) that all these changes are part of a "
"whole."
msgstr ""
"Dodavanje fajla u projekat zahtjeva dva koraka:prvi, fajl mora biti "
"registrovan sa &CVS;, ili drugim riječima <emphasis>dodano u skladište</"
"emphasis>. Ovo je neophodno, ali nedovoljno. Da bi se fajl dodao u "
"skladište, morate  <emphasis>učiniti</emphasis> njih. Ova procedura ima "
"bitan izazov: možete dodati fajlove zajedno sa modifikacijom u druge "
"dijelove projekta. Kad ste uradili ovo, možete lahko vidjeti (&eg;učiniti u "
"emailu) sve ove promjene su dio cjeline."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:955
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To this end, mark all files to be added in &cervisia;'s main view. Then, "
"choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add to Repository...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or right click the marked files and choose "
"<guimenuitem>Add to Repository...</guimenuitem>. The <guilabel>CVS Add</"
"guilabel> dialog will appear, listing the files you marked, and asks for "
"confirmation. Press <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Na kraju, označite sve fajlove da budu dodani u &cervisia;'s glavni izgled. "
"Onda, izaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</guimenu><guimenuitem>Dodaj u "
"Skladište...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,ili desnim klikom na označene "
"fajlove i biraj <guimenuitem>Dodati u Skladište...</guimenuitem>."
"<guilabel>CVS Add</guilabel> diajlog će se pojaviti, izlistavanje fajlova "
"koje ste označili,i pitajte za potvrdu. Pritisnite <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:964 index.docbook:992
#, no-c-format
msgid "&cervisia; issues a command"
msgstr "&cervisia; izdaje naredbu"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:967
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs add <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr "<command>cvs add <replaceable>imena fajlova</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:970
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the operation was successful, the status column should have \"Added to "
"repository\" for the added files."
msgstr ""
"Ako je operacija bila uspješna, statusna kolumna bi trebala biti \"Added to "
"repository\"za dodane fajlove."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:975
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&CVS; is not designed to provide meaningful revision control for binary "
"files. For example, merging binary files normally does not make sense. "
"Furthermore, by default &CVS; performs keyword expansion (&eg; on the string "
"<literal>&dollar;Revision: 1.6 &dollar;</literal>) when a file is committed. "
"In binary files, such replacements may corrupt the file and make it "
"completely unusable."
msgstr ""
"&CVS;nije dizajniran smisleno za reviziju kontrole binarnih fajlova. Na "
"primjer, označavanje binarnih fajlove normalno nema smisla. U nastavu, po "
"defaultu &CVS; obavlja proširenje ključnih riječi  (&eg; on the string "
"<literal>&dollar;Revision: 1.6 &dollar;</literal>) kad je fajl završen. U "
"binarnom fajlu, takve zamjene mogu oštetiti fajl i učiniti ih beskorisnim."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:984
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to switch the above behavior off, you should commit binary files "
"(or other files, like Postscript or PNG images) by choosing "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add Binary...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. The <guilabel>CVS Add</guilabel> dialog will appear, listing "
"the binary files you marked, and asks for confirmation. Press <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"U smislu gašenja ovog ponašanja, trebate načiniti binarni fajl  (ili druge "
"fajlove, kao Postscript ili PNG slike)  birajući <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Dodaj Binarno...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. "
"<guilabel>CVS Add</guilabel> diajlog će se pojaviti, listing binarnih "
"označenih fajlova, i pitajte za potvrdu. Pritisnite <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:997
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs add -kb <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs add -kb <replaceable>nazivi fajlova</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1004
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing Files"
msgstr "Uklanjanje Fajlova"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1006
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like adding files, removing files is done in two steps: First, the files "
"have to be registered as removed by choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Remove From Repository...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or "
"right clicking the marked files and choosing <guimenuitem>Remove From "
"Repository...</guimenuitem> from the context menu. The <guilabel>CVS Remove</"
"guilabel> dialog will appear, listing the files you marked, and asking for "
"confirmation. Press <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. &cervisia; issues the command"
msgstr ""
"Kao dodavanje fajlova, uklanjanje fajlova se završava u dva koraka: Prvi, "
"fajlovi moraju biti registrovani kao uklanjanje po izboru "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ukloniti Iz Skladišta...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili desni klik na označene fajlove i izabrane "
"<guimenuitem>Ukloni Iz Skladišta...</guimenuitem> iz kontekstnog izbornika."
"<guilabel>CVS Remove</guilabel> dijalog će se pojaviti, izlistavajući "
"označene fajlove, i tražeći potvrdu. Pritisnite <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. "
"&cervisia; issues the command"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:1017
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs remove -f <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs remove -f <replaceable>nazivi fajlova</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1020
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After that, this modification to the sandbox has to be committed, possibly "
"together with other modifications to the project."
msgstr ""
"Nakon tog, ova modifikacija u pješčanoj kutiji je urađena, po mogućnosti "
"zajedno sa ostalim modifikacijama na projektu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1025
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The above command only works if the file is up-to-date. Otherwise, you get "
"an error message. This behavior is sensible: If you have modified the file "
"compared to the version in the repository, or if someone else has made any "
"modifications, you will first want to check if you really want to discard "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Komanda iznad radi samo u slučaju ako je današnja verzija fajla. U drugom "
"slučaju, dobit ćete poruku sa greškom. Ovo ponašanje je osjetljivo: Ako ste "
"modifikovali fajl u skladu sa verzijom u skladištu, ili ako je neko drugi "
"uradio modifikaciju, prvo ćete željeti provjeriti da li ih stvarno želite "
"odbaciti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1037
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding and Removing Folders"
msgstr "Dodavanje i Uklanjanje Foldera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1039
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Folders are handled fundamentally different from ordinary files by &CVS;. "
"They are not under revision control, &ie; you cannot tell which folders "
"existed in the project at a certain time. Furthermore, folders can never be "
"explicitly removed (except by removing them directly in the repository)."
msgstr ""
"Rukovanje sa folderima je fundamentalno drugačije od uobičajnih fajlova od "
"&CVS;. Oni nisu pod revizijskom kontrolom &ie; ne možete reći koji je folder "
"postojao u koje vrijeme. U nastavku, folderi ne mogu biti eksplicitno "
"uklonjeni (uklanjanje direkto iz skladišta)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1047
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As a substitute, &CVS; follows the convention that a folder is \"non-existent"
"\" in a version of the project if it is empty. This convention can be "
"enforced by using the option <option>-P</option> to <command>cvs update</"
"command> and <command>cvs checkout</command>. This option can be set in the "
"menu <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Prune Empty Folders "
"on Update</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Kao zamjena, &CVS; prati konvencije da je folder \"non-existent\"u verziji "
"da je projekat prazan. Ova konvencija može biti prisilna koristeći opciju "
"<option>-P</option> to <command>cvs update</command> i  <command>cvs "
"checkout</command>. Ova opcija može biti namještena u izborniku "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Odrezati Prazni Folder  "
"on Update</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1056
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A folder can be added to the repository choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Add to Repository...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or "
"right clicking the marked folder and choosing <guimenuitem>Add to "
"Repository...</guimenuitem> from the context menu. Note that in contrast to "
"adding files, adding folders does not require a commit afterwards. "
"&cervisia; issues the command"
msgstr ""
"Folder može biti dodan u skladište birajući <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Dodaj U Skladište...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili "
"desni klin na označeni folder i biranje <guimenuitem>Dodavanje u Skladište..."
"</guimenuitem> iz kontekstnog izbornika. Imajte na umu da dodavanje fajlova, "
"dodavanje foldera ne zahtjeva početak nakon toga &cervisia; izdaje naredbu"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:1067
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs add <replaceable>dirname</replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs add <replaceable>naziv direktorija</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1074
#, no-c-format
msgid "Committing Files"
msgstr "Izvršenje Fajlova"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1076
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you have made a certain number of changes to your working copy, and you "
"want other developers to have access to them, you <emphasis>commit</"
"emphasis> them. With a commit, you place your versions of the modified files "
"as new revisions into the repository. A subsequent update by another "
"developer will bring your modifications into their working copy."
msgstr ""
"Kad ste uradili određeni broj promjena na radnoj kopiji, i želite da drugi "
"učesnici imaju pristup njoj, vi  <emphasis>izvršiti</emphasis> njih. Sa "
"izvršenjem, postavljate svoju verziju modificiranih fajlova kao novu "
"reviziju u skladište. Naknadni update drugog razvijača će prenijeti vaše "
"modifikacije u njihovu radnu kopiju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1084
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to commit a couple of files, select them in &cervisia;'s main view "
"and choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Commit...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> or right click the marked files and choose "
"<guimenuitem>Commit...</guimenuitem> from the context menu."
msgstr ""
"Da bi se počinilo nekoliko fajlova, selektujte ih u &cervisia;'s glavni "
"izgled i biraj <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</guimenu><guimenuitem>Izvršiti...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili desni klikna označene fajlove i izaberite "
"<guimenuitem>Izvršiti...</guimenuitem> iz kontekstnog izbornika."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1093
#, no-c-format
msgid "A screenshot of &cervisia;'s commit dialog"
msgstr "A slika ekrana od  &cervisia;'s počiniti dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1099
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You get a dialog that shows you a list of the selected files on the top "
"section and a log message for your changes below. &cervisia; helps you in "
"several ways to find a meaningful log message: first, in the file list you "
"can double-click a file or press <keycap>Return</keycap> in order to see the "
"changes you have made to the file. Second, it gives you a list of log "
"messages you have previously used in a combo box. Third, this dialog is "
"integrated with &cervisia;'s changelog editor described below. When you have "
"finished the dialog, the command"
msgstr ""
"Dobijete dijalog koji vam prikazuje listu selektovanih fajlova na vrhu i log "
"poruku za vaše izmjene ispod. &cervisia; pomaže vam u pojednim trenutcima da "
"pronađete smislen log poruke: prvo, na listi fajlova možete dva puta da "
"kliknete na fajl ili pritisnuti <keycap>Povratak</keycap> u smislu da vidite "
"promjene koje ste uradili na fajlu. Drugi, daje vam listu log porkua koju "
"ste prethodno koristili. Treće, ovaj dijalog je integrisan sa &cervisia;'s "
"promjenama uređena opisa ispod. Kad ste završili sa dijalogom, komanda."

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:1111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>cvs commit -m <replaceable>message</replaceable> <replaceable>file "
"names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs commit -m <replaceable>message</replaceable> "
"<replaceable>nazivi fajlova</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1114
#, no-c-format
msgid "is used."
msgstr "je korišteno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A common error you may encounter when committing is <errorname>Up-to-date "
"check failed</errorname>. This indicates that someone has committed changes "
"to the repository since you last updated; or, more technically, that your "
"<literal>BASE</literal> revision is not the newest on its branch. In such a "
"case, &CVS; refuses to merge your modifications into the repository. The "
"solution is to update, resolve any conflicts and commit again. Of course, if "
"you are working on a software project, it is normally good style to check if "
"the program still works after you have updated - after all, there could be "
"bad interactions between your modifications and the other modifications "
"which break the code."
msgstr ""
"Uobičajna greška koja se može desiti je <errorname> Up-to-date greška </"
"errorname>. Ovo indicira da je neko uradio promjene u skladištu od vašeg "
"zadnjeg update; ili više tehnički, nego vaš  <literal>BASE</literal> "
"revizija nije najnovina na grani. U takvom slučaju &CVS; odbija da spoji "
"modifikacije u skladište. Izlaz je da update, riješava svaki konflikt i "
"počinje opet. Naravno, ako radite na softver projektu, to je normalan stil "
"za provjeru programa poslije update- nakon svega, može doći do loše "
"interakcije između modifikacija i drugih modifikacija za prekid koda."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another popular mistake results in the error message <errorname>Sticky tag "
"'X' for file 'X' is not a branch</errorname>. This happens if you try to "
"commit a file which you have previously brought to a certain revision or tag "
"with the command"
msgstr ""
"Druga popularni rezultat greške je poruka s greškom <errorname>Sticky tag "
"'X' for file 'X' is not a branch</errorname>. Ovo se dešava ako želite "
"izvršiti prethodni fajl donijet radi određene revizije ili označen sa "
"komandama."

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:1139
#, no-c-format
msgid "<prompt>%</prompt><userinput>cvs update -r X</userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>%</prompt><userinput>cvs update -r X</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"(which is &eg; used by the menu item <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Update to Tag/Date...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>). In "
"such a case, the tag on the file gets sticky, &ie; further updates do not "
"bring you to the newest revision on the branch. If you want to commit "
"further revisions to the branch, you have to update to the branch tag before "
"you do further commits."
msgstr ""
"(which is &eg; korišteno od stavke iz izbornika "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</guimenu><guimenuitem>Update do Oznake/"
"Datum...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>). U takvom slučaju, oznaka na fajlu "
"postaje ljepljiva, &ie; dalji updates ne donosi vam najnoviju reviziju u "
"branch. Ako želite vi da nastavite reviziju u branch, morate update branch "
"oznaku prije nego nastavite dalje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With &cervisia;, it is quite easy to maintain a ChangeLog file that is "
"compliant with the format laid out in the &GNU; coding guidelines. To use "
"it, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Insert ChangeLog "
"Entry...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. If a file with the name "
"<filename>ChangeLog</filename> exists in the toplevel folder of your "
"sandbox, this file will be loaded and you have the possibility to edit it. "
"To this end, at the top of the file, an entry with the current date and your "
"user name (which can be configured as described in <xref linkend=\"customize-"
"general\"/>) is inserted. When you are finished the dialog can be closed by "
"clicking <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, the next commit dialog you open will "
"have the log message set to the message you last entered in the ChangeLog."
msgstr ""
"Sa &cervisia;, je veoma lahko održati ChangeLog fajl koji je popustljiv sa "
"formatom navednim u &GNU; smjernice za kodiranje. Da biste koristili, "
"izaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ubacite  ChangeLog "
"Unos...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>.Ako fajl sa imenom <filename>ChangeLog</"
"filename> postoji u najvećem levelu foldera u pješčanoj kutiju, ovaj fajl bi "
"bio pokrenut i imat čete mogučnost da ga uređujete. Do kraja, na vru fajla, "
"unos sa trenutnim podatcima i vašim korisničkim imenim (koji mogu biti "
"konfigurisani kako je opisano u <xref linkend=\"customize-general\"/>)  je "
"unešeno. Kad ste završili dijalog može biti zatvoren klikanjem na "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton>, slijedeći dijalog koji otvorite posjeduje log "
"poruku postavljenu u porukama kad ste zadnji put ušli u ChangeLog."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resolving Conflicts"
msgstr "Riješavanje Sukoba"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Conflicts may occur whenever you have made changes to a file which was also "
"modified by another developer. The conflict is detected by &CVS; when you "
"update the modified file; &CVS; then tries to merge the modifications "
"committed by the other developer into your working copy. The merge fails if "
"both your and his modifications are in overlapping parts of the file, and "
"the &CVS; server issues an error message."
msgstr ""
"Konflikt se može desiti kad god ste napravili promjene na fajlu koji je "
"modifikovan od drugog proizvođača. Konflikt se detektuje pomoću &CVS; kad "
"uradite update modifikovanog fajla &CVS; onda pokušajte da označite "
"modigikacije urađene od drugog proizvođača u vašu radnu kopiju. Označena "
"neizvršenja od vas i drugog proizvođača na modifikacijama preklapanja "
"fajlova, i &CVS; služi za popravak grešaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &cervisia;'s main view, files with conflicts are indicated with \"Conflict"
"\" in the status column and with a red color. It is your job now to resolve "
"these conflicts before you commit the file. &CVS; will refuse to commit any "
"files with conflicts until they have been edited. From the main view, you "
"can of course resolve conflicts the traditional way: just double-click the "
"file in question and edit it with your favorite editor."
msgstr ""
"U &cervisia;'s glavni pregled, fajlovi koji su u konfliktu sa \"Conflict\" u "
"statusnoj kolumni i sa crveno bojom. Vaš je posao da sada riješite ovaj "
"konflikt prije izvršenja fajla.  &CVS; će odbiti izvršenje nekog fajla sa "
"konfliktom dok nisu uređeni. Za glavni pogled, možete naravno riješiti "
"konflikte na tradicionalan način: samo dupli klik na fajl na pitanje i "
"uređivanje tog sa najdražim urednikom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&CVS; marks the conflicting changes by placing marks in the middle of the "
"files, in the following manner:"
msgstr ""
"&CVS; označuje promjene konflikta stavljanjem oznaka u sredinu fajla, u "
"pratećem maniru:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:1192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;\n"
"Changes in your working copy\n"
"=======\n"
"Changes in the repository\n"
"&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; revision_number"
msgstr ""
"&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;\n"
"Changes in your working copy\n"
"=======\n"
"Changes in the repository\n"
"&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; revision_number"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should replace this whole block with the new merged version. Of course, "
"you have a great amount of freedom when resolving a set of conflicts: for "
"each conflict you can decide to take one of the two alternative versions. "
"You can also decide that both approaches are broken and rewrite a whole "
"routine or the complete file from scratch."
msgstr ""
"Trebali biste zamijeniti cijeli blok označene verzije. Naravno, imate super "
"količinu slobode kad riješite set konflikata: za svaki konflikt možete "
"odlučiti da uzmete jednu ili dvije alternativne verzije. Možete također "
"odlučiti da oba pristupa budu pokvarena i prepisana preko cijele rutine ili "
"kompletnog fajla-."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Fortunately, &cervisia; offers a nicer interface for handling these "
"conflicts. This does not mean that you will never need to manually edit the "
"files, but at least can eliminate the need to do so for the trivial conflict "
"resolution. To use &cervisia;'s <guilabel>CVS Resolve</guilabel> dialog "
"choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Resolve...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> or right click the marked file and choose "
"<guimenuitem>Resolve...</guimenuitem> from the context menu."
msgstr ""
"Na sreću &cervisia; nudi ljepše sučeljenje za riješavanje ovih konflikata. "
"Ovo ne znači da vi nećete nikad više morati ručno uređivati fajlove, ali "
"najmanje možete eliminisati potrebu za trivijalnim riješenjem konflikata. Da "
"bi koristili &cervisia;'s <guilabel>CVS Resolve</guilabel> dialog choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</guimenu><guimenuitem>Riješi...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ili desni klik na označeni fajl i izaberite "
"<guimenuitem>Riješi...</guimenuitem> iz kontekstnom izborniku."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1212
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s resolve dialog</title>"
msgstr "<title>A slike ekrana od &cervisia;'s riješavanje dijaloga</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1215
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s resolve dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>A slika ekrana od &cervisia;'s riješavanje dijaloga</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1219
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the top of the dialog, you see <guilabel>Your version (A)</guilabel> of "
"the file on the left hand side and the version in the repository, "
"<guilabel>Other version (B)</guilabel>, on the right hand side. The "
"differences between them are marked in red color. Below these two versions, "
"you can see the <guilabel>Merged version</guilabel>. The merged version "
"reflects what that section will be in your working copy if you press the "
"<guibutton>Save</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Na vrhu dijaloga, vidite <guilabel>Vaša verzija(A)</guilabel> fajl na "
"lijevoj strani i verziju u skladištu , <guilabel>Druga verzija (B)</"
"guilabel>,na desnoj strani. Razlika između su oznake u boji. Ispod ove dvije "
"verzije, možete vidjeti  <guilabel>Označene verzije</guilabel>. Označena "
"verzija reflektuje koja sekcija će biti u vašoj radnoj kopiji ako pritisnete "
"<guibutton>Sačuvaj </guibutton> dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1229
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can go back and forward between the conflicting sections by pressing "
"<guibutton>&lt;&lt;</guibutton> and <guibutton>&gt;&gt;</guibutton>. In the "
"lower middle of the dialog you can see which section is currently marked. "
"For example, <literal>2 of 3</literal> means that you are currently at the "
"second differing section of 3 total."
msgstr ""
"Možete ići nazad i naprijed izmeđi konfliktnih sekcija pritiskanjem "
"<guibutton>&lt;&lt;</guibutton> i <guibutton>&gt;&gt;</guibutton>. U sredini "
"dijaloga možete vidjeti sekciju koja je trenutno označena. Na primjer, "
"<literal>2 of 3</literal> znači da ste trenutno na drugoj različitoj sekciji "
"od 3 ukupno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1237
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you can decide section by section which version you want to have in the "
"merged file. By pressing <guibutton>A</guibutton>, you take over the version "
"you edited. By pressing <guibutton>B</guibutton>, you take over the version "
"from the repository. By pressing <guibutton>A+B</guibutton>, both versions "
"will be added, and your version will come first. <guibutton>B+A</guibutton> "
"yields the same result, but the order will be different: first the "
"repository version, then yours."
msgstr ""
"Sada možete izabrati sekciju po sekciju koju verziju želite da imate "
"označenu u fajlu. Pritiskanjem<guibutton>A</guibutton>,preuzimate verziju "
"koju ste uređivali. Pritiskanjem  <guibutton>B</guibutton>,preuzimate "
"verziju iz skladišta.  Pritiskanjem <guibutton>A+B</guibutton>, obe verzije "
"će biti dodane, i vaša verzija će biti prva. <guibutton>B+A</"
"guibutton>prinosi imaju iste rezultate, ali poredak će biti drugačiji:prvo "
"skladišna verzija, zatim vaša."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are not happy with any of these versions, press <guibutton>Edit</"
"guibutton> to open a simple text editor where you can edit the section. When "
"you are finished editing, press <guibutton>OK</guibutton> to return to the "
"<guilabel>CVS Resolve</guilabel> dialog and resume solving conflicts. You "
"will see the section you just edited in the <guilabel>Merged version</"
"guilabel>, with your modifications."
msgstr ""
"Ako niste zadovoljni ni sa jednom od ovih verzija, pritisnite "
"<guibutton>Urediti </guibutton> da otvorite tekst uređivač gdje možete da "
"uredite sekciju. Kad ste završili sa uređivanjem, pritisnite <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> da biste se vratili <guilabel>CVS Resolve</guilabel> dijalog i "
"nastaviti riješenje za konflikt. Vidjet ćete sekciju koju ste uredili u "
"<guilabel>Označena Verzija</guilabel>, sa vašim modifikacijama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1256
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To save your modifications, overwriting the working copy version, press "
"<guibutton>Save</guibutton>. Note that this will save the choices not only "
"the section you are currently viewing, but all sections in the file. If you "
"want to save it to another file, press <guibutton>Save As...</guibutton>. "
"Press <guibutton>Close</guibutton> to exit the dialog. If you close the "
"dialog without saving, the changes you made will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Da sačuvate modifikacije, pisanje preko radne kopije, pritisnite "
"<guibutton>Sačuvaj</guibutton>.  Imajte na umu da će ovo sačuvati izbore ne "
"samo sekcije koju trenutno gledate, već i sve sekcije u fajlu. Ako želite da "
"sačuvate u drugi fajl, pritisnite <guibutton>Sačuvaj Kao...</guibutton>. "
"Pritisnite  <guibutton>Zatvori</guibutton> da iziđete iz dijaloga. Ako "
"zatvorite dijalog a da niste sačuvali, promjene će biti izgubljene."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1271
#, no-c-format
msgid "Obtaining Information About Files and Creating Patches"
msgstr "Dobijanje Informacija O Fajlovima i Kreiranje Znakova"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1274
#, no-c-format
msgid "Watching Differences Between Revisions"
msgstr "Gledanje Razlika Između Revizije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are several places in &cervisia; where you can ask for a window "
"showing the differences between revisions of a file:"
msgstr ""
"Postoji nekoliko mjesta u &cervisia; gdje možete pitati za prozorni prikaz "
"razlika revizija fajlova:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the main view, you can choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Difference to Repository (BASE)...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. This is based on the command <command>cvs diff</command> and "
"shows you the differences between the version in your sandbox and the "
"version to which you last updated (also known as <literal>BASE</literal>). "
"This is in particular useful just before you commit a file, so you can find "
"an appropriate log message."
msgstr ""
"U glavnom pregledu, možete birati <menuchoice><guimenu> Pregled</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem> Razlike u Skladištenju  (BASE)...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>.  Ovo je bazirano na komandi <command>cvs diff</command> i "
"prikazuje vam razliku između verzije u pješčanoj kutiji i one koju ste "
"zadnju update (također poznatu kao <literal>BASE</literal>).Ovo je "
"djelomično korisno ali samo prije nego napravite fajl,tako da možete pronaći "
"odgovarajući log za poruku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can view the differences between the version in your sandbox and the "
"version in the main development branch (also called <literal>HEAD</literal>) "
"by choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Difference to "
"Repository (HEAD)...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Možete vidjeti razlike između verzije u pješćanoj kutiji u verziju u glavnom "
"razvoju (također poznatu kao <literal>HEAD</literal>) biranjem  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Razlike u Skladištenju "
"(HEAD)...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can view the differences between the last two revisions of the selected "
"file choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Last Change..."
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Možete vidjeti razlike između zadnje dvije revizije selektovanih fajlova "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zadnja Izmjena...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1306
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can access the <guimenuitem>Difference to Repository (BASE)...</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Difference to Repository (HEAD)...</guimenuitem> "
"and <guimenuitem>Last Change...</guimenuitem> menu items from the main view "
"context menu, by right-clicking the file you want to view."
msgstr ""
"Možete pristupiti <guimenuitem> Razlike u Skladištenju  (BASE)...</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem> Razlike u Skladištenju (HEAD)...</guimenuitem> "
"i  <guimenuitem>  Zadnje Izmjene </guimenuitem> stavke izbornika za glavni "
"kontekstni izbornik, desnim klikom na fajl koji želite vidjeti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1313
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the dialog that is shown when a you commit a set of files, you can "
"request a difference window by selecting a file name in the selection list, "
"either by double-clicking it or by pressing <keycap>Return</keycap>. This is "
"quite similar to using <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Difference to Repository (BASE)...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> with the respective file in the main view."
msgstr ""
"U dijalogu koji je prikazan kad napravite fajlove, možete tražiti prozore za "
"razlike selktovanjem imena fakjla na selekcionoj listi, ili duplim klikom "
"ili pritiskanje  <keycap>Povratak</keycap>. Ovo je slično korištenju "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Pregled</guimenu><guimenuitem> Razlike u Skladištenju  "
"(BASE)...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>sa odnosnim fajlom u glavnom izborniku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1322
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the Browse Logs dialog, you can mark two revisions of a file and request "
"a dialog showing the differences between them (see <xref linkend="
"\"browsinglogs\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"U dijalogu Pregleda logs, možete označiti dvije revizije fajlova i tražiti "
"dijalog koji pokazuje razlike između njih (see <xref linkend=\"browsinglogs"
"\"/>)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1329
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As you may have expected, &cervisia; does not just dump the output of the "
"<command>diff</command> command into your terminal, but shows you a "
"graphical view as seen in <xref linkend=\"screenshot-log\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Kao što ste očekivali &cervisia; ne izbacuje samo izlaz iz <command>diff</"
"command> komandu u vaš terminal, ali vam pokazuje grafički prikaz kao što je "
"viđen u  <xref linkend=\"screenshot-log\"/>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1336
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s diff dialog</title>"
msgstr "<title>A slike ekrana od  &cervisia;'s diff dijalog</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1339
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s diff dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>A slike ekrana &cervisia;'s diff dijalog</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1343
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The text in the dialog is an improved variant of the text given by the diff "
"command with the <option>-u</option> option. You can see the differing "
"versions in two windows, with lines arranged such that you can do a side-by-"
"side comparison. That means, where text has been added or deleted, the "
"respective window shows empty lines with the marker <literal>+++++</literal> "
"at the left hand side. Elsewhere, you can see the running number of each "
"line in the left column."
msgstr ""
"Tekst u dijalogu je poboljšana verzija teksta datog od diff komandom sa "
"<option>-u</option> opcije. Možete pogledati različite verzije u dva "
"prozora, s linijama tako podijeljenim da možete gledati jedan pored drugog. "
"To znači, gdje je tekst dodan ili obrisan, pokazni prozor pokazuje prazne "
"označene linije  <literal>+++++</literal>sa lijeve strane. Drugačije, možete "
"vidjeti broj linija na lijevoj strani kolone."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1353
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the second column in the right window, you can see which kind of change "
"has been made. Possible types are <literal>Add</literal>, <literal>Delete</"
"literal> and <literal>Change</literal>. The respective lines are marked in "
"blue, green and red color. In the middle of the dialog a compressed image of "
"the color markers is shown. In this way, you can get a quick overview of the "
"overall changes to the file. You can also use the position of the colored "
"regions in the compressed image as an orientation when you using the scroll "
"bars."
msgstr ""
"U drugoj koloni na desnoj strani prozora, koje promjene su napravljene. "
"Mogući tipovi  <literal>Dodaj</literal>, <literal>Izbriši</literal> i "
"<literal>Promijeni</literal>. Predstavljene linije su označene plavom bojom, "
"zelenom ili crvenom. U sredini dijaloga kompresovana označena slika je "
"označena u prikazu. U ovom slučaju, možete dobiti brzi pregled svih promjena "
"u fajlu. Možete također koristiti poziciju obojenih regija u kompresovanoj "
"slici kao orijentaciju kad koristite scroll bars."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1364
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Normally, the scrollbars at the left and the right window are synchronized, "
"&ie; if you scroll on the left hand side, the right hand side is scrolled by "
"the same amount. You can change this by checking the box "
"<guibutton>Synchronize scroll bars</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Normalno, scrollbars na lijevoj i desnoj strani su sinhronizovani, &ie; ako "
"spustite na lijevu stranu, desna strana će se spustiti sama. Možete "
"promijeniti ovu provjerom <guibutton>Sinhronizovano spuštanje</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1371
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For information about how to customize the diff dialog, see <xref linkend="
"\"customize-diff\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija kako organizovati vaš diff dijalog, pogledajte <xref "
"linkend=\"customize-diff\"/>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1378
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating Patches"
msgstr "Kreiranje Znakova"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1380
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes you want to offer your modifications for review, before committing "
"them, or you do not have write access to the repository (therefore you "
"cannot commit). &CVS; offers standard formats to share the modifications in "
"your working copy, so other people can review your changes, test them in "
"their working copy and apply them to the &CVS; repository. A file containing "
"these differences is called a <firstterm>patch</firstterm>, and is generated "
"by the <command>cvs diff</command> command, in the same way as the "
"differences in <xref linkend=\"diff\"/>. Sharing patches instead of sets of "
"files requires less bandwidth, and patches are easier to handle, as you can "
"send only one patch file containing all the differences from many source "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad možete ponuditi modifikovani pregled, prije činjenja, ili ne morate "
"pisati dopust u skladište ( zbog toga ne možete uraditi).  &CVS; nudi "
"standardne formate za dijeljenje modifikacije u vašoj radnoj kopiji, tako da "
"ostali ljudi mogu vidjeti vaše promjene, testirajte ih u njihovoj radnoj "
"kopiji i ubacite ih u &CVS; skladište. Fajl koji sadrži ove razlike zove se  "
"<firstterm>zakrpa</firstterm>,i generisan je <command>cvs diff</command> "
"komandom, u istom smislu kao razlike u <xref linkend=\"diff\"/>. Dijeleći "
"puteve umjesto setova fajlova umjesto propusnosti, i putevima je lakše "
"upravljati, kao što možete poslati samo jedanu zakrpu fajla sadržavajući sve "
"razlike sa svih izvora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1393
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cervisia; gives you access to this feature by choosing "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Create Patch Against "
"Repository...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"&cervisia; odobrava vam ulaz biranjem <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Create Patch Against Repository...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Create Patch Against Repository...</guimenuitem> action "
"creates a patch with all modifications in all files in your working copy "
"(sandbox) against the <literal>BASE</literal> repository. Therefore, the "
"selection of files in the main view does not affect the patch that will be "
"generated."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Kreirajte Zakrpe Protiv Skladištenja...</guimenuitem> akcija "
"kreira zakrpu sa modifikacijama u svim fajlovima u vašoj radnoj kopiji "
"(sandbox) prema <literal>BASE</literal> skladištu. Zbog tog, ova selekcija "
"fajlova u glavnom pregledu ne utiče na zakrpu i bit će generisana."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1407
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Another possibility is to select one file in the main view and choose "
#| "<guimenuitem>Browse Log...</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>View</guimenu> "
#| "menu or right click the marked file and choose <guimenuitem>Browse Log..."
#| "</guimenuitem> from the context menu, in order to open the <link linkend="
#| "\"browsinglogs\">Browse log dialog</link>. Now, select the version you "
#| "want to create a patch against, as revision &quot;A&quot; and press the "
#| "button <guilabel>Create Patch...</guilabel>. This will generate a patch "
#| "with the differences between the <emphasis>marked file</emphasis> in your "
#| "working copy and the version selected as revision &quot;A&quot;."
msgid ""
"Another possibility is to select one file in the main view and choose "
"<guimenuitem>Browse Log...</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"menu or right click the marked file and choose <guimenuitem>Browse Log...</"
"guimenuitem> from the context menu, in order to open the <link linkend="
"\"browsinglogs\">Browse log dialog</link>. Now, select the version you want "
"to create a patch against, as revision <quote>A</quote> and press the button "
"<guilabel>Create Patch...</guilabel>. This will generate a patch with the "
"differences between the <emphasis>marked file</emphasis> in your working "
"copy and the version selected as revision <quote>A</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Druga mogućnost je selektovanje glavnog pregleda i biranje "
"<guimenuitem>Traženje Log...</guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> "
"izbornika ili desni klik na markirane fajlove i birajte "
"<guimenuitem>Traženje Log...</guimenuitem> iz kontekstnog izbornika, u "
"smislu otvaranja  <link linkend=\"browsinglogs\">Traženjelog dijalog</link>."
"Sad, selektujte verziju za koju želite kreirati zakrpu protiv, kao revizija "
"&quot;A&quot; i pritisnite dugme <guilabel>Kreirajte Zakrpu</guilabel>.  Ovo "
"će generirati zakrpu sa razlikama između <emphasis>označenih fajlova</"
"emphasis> u vašoj radnoj kopiji i selektovana verzija za reviziju kao &quot;"
"A&quot;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1419
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before generating the patch, &cervisia; displays a dialog allowing you to "
"configure the output format."
msgstr ""
"Prije generisanja zakrpe, &cervisia; prikazuje dijalog koji vam dozvoljava "
"konfiguraciju izlaznog formata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1425
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s patch dialog</title>"
msgstr "<title>Slika ekrana od  &cervisia;'s dijaloga znakova</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1428
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s patch dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>slika ekrana &cervisia;' dijaloga zakrpa</phrase>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1435
#, no-c-format
msgid "Output Format"
msgstr "Izlazni Format"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1436
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are three output formats available:"
msgstr "Postoje tri izlazna formata dostupna:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1439
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Normal</guilabel>: a format that can be used to cause the ed "
"editor to automatically make another copy of the old file match the new "
"file. In the normal output format, the characters &lt; and &gt; mark the "
"changes, and there is no context information."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Normalan</guilabel>: format koji se može koristiti da urednik "
"automatski napravi kopiju fajla. U normalnom izlaznom formatu, oznake &lt; "
"i  &gt; označuju promjene, i ne postoje kontekstne informacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1445
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Unified</guilabel>: the most used format for exchanging patches. "
"The unified format uses context lines in addition to line numbers to record "
"the differences. This makes the process of applying patches more robust. "
"This format displays the differences in a compact and readable form, with a "
"header for each file involved, and separate sections (chunks) for each "
"difference. The context lines available for each difference make reading the "
"modifications easier. In the unified output format, the characters + and - "
"mark the changes."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ujedinjeni</guilabel>: najvišer korišten format za razmjenu "
"zakrpa. Ujedinjenji format koristi kontekstne linije u dodavanju brojeva "
"linija da se snime razlike. Ovo čini proces stavljana zakrpa jačim. Ovaj "
"format prikazuje razlike u kompaktnoj i čitajučoj formi, sa header za svaki "
"fajl uključen, u različitim sekcijama za svaku razliku. Kontekstne linije su "
"dostupne za svaku razliku i čine čitanje modifikacija lakše. U ujedinjenom "
"output formatu, znakovi+i+markiranje promjena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1455
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Context</guilabel>, which presents the same information as the "
"unified format, but in a less compact way. In the context output format, the "
"character ! marks the changes."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kontekst</guilabel>,koji prezentuje iste informacije ujedinjene u "
"format, ali u manje kompaktnom načinu. U kontekstnom izlatnom formatu, "
"oznake ! označuju promjene."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1463
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of context lines:"
msgstr "Broj kontekstni linija:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1464
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set here the number of context lines for the unified or context output "
"formats. This option is not available for the normal output format, as in "
"this format no context information is recorded. More context information "
"makes reading the raw output easier, and applying the patch more precise, "
"but increases the patch size. It is recommended to use at least two context "
"lines for proper patch operation."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte ovdje broj kontekstnih linija za ujedinjene ili kontekstne output "
"formate. Ova opcija nije dostupna za normalni output formate, kao u ovom "
"formatu bez kontekstna informacija snimljena. Više kontekstnih informacija "
"čini čitanje raw outputa lakše, i lijepi zakrpu više precizno, ali povećava "
"veličinu zakrpe. Preporučljivo je korištenje najmanje dvije kontekstne "
"linije za pravilne zakrpne operacije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1475
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ignore Options"
msgstr "Ignoriši Opcije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1476
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check here the changes that should not be considered as differences when "
"generating the patch."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite promjene koje se trebaju uzeti u obzir kao promjene u generalnom "
"putu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1485
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After setting the output format, &cervisia; generates the patch and displays "
"the <guilabel>Save As</guilabel> dialog. Enter in this dialog the file name "
"and location of the patch file."
msgstr ""
"Nakon postavljanja output formata &cervisia; generira put i prikazuje  "
"<guilabel>Sačuvaj kao</guilabel> dijalog. Unesite u ovaj dijalog ime fajla i "
"lokaciju fajla."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1495
#, no-c-format
msgid "Watching an Annotated View of a File"
msgstr "Pregledanje Rastavljenog Pregleda Fajla"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1497
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With the command <command>cvs annotate</command>, &CVS; offers the "
"possibility to see - for each line in a file - who has modified a line the "
"most recently. This view may be helpful in order to find out who has "
"introduced a change in the behavior of a program or who should be asked "
"about some change or bug in the code."
msgstr ""
"Sa komandom  <command>cvs annotate</command>, &CVS;  nudi mogućnosti da se "
"vidi-za svaku liniju u fajlu-koji je modificirao linije zadnju korištenu. "
"Ovaj pregled može biti od pomoći da saznamo koje napravio promjene u "
"ponašanju programa ili ko treba biti pitan o promjenama ili o bug u kodu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1505
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cervisia; gives you access to this feature, but it further enriches the "
"information in an interactive way. You obtain an annotate view by choosing "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Annotate...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. Another possibility is to press the button <guilabel>Annotate</"
"guilabel> in the <link linkend=\"browsinglogs\">Browse log dialog</link>, in "
"which you can select which version of the file you want to display. In <xref "
"linkend=\"screenshot-annotate\"/> you can see a screenshot of the dialog."
msgstr ""
"&cersia; daje vam pristup karakteristikama, ali u daljem obogaćavanju "
"informacija u interakaktivnom načinu. Vi ćete dobiti pribilješke birajući  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Pregled</guimenu><guimenuitem> Pribilježiti...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>.Druga mogućnost jeste da pritisnete dugme "
"<guilabel>Pribilježiti</guilabel> u  <link linkend=\"browsinglogs\">Traženje "
"log dijaloga </link>, u kojem možete selektovati koju verziju fajla želite "
"da prikažete. U <xref linkend=\"screenshot-annotate\"/> možete vidjeti sliku "
"ekrana dijaloga."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1517
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s annotate dialog</title>"
msgstr "<title>A slika ekrana &cervisia;'s pribilježiti dijalog</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1520
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s annotate dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>A slika ekrana &cervisia;'s pribilježiti dijalog</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1524
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In the annotate dialog, you see in a window the latest version of the "
#| "selected file (or the revision &quot;A&quot; version, in case you "
#| "launched the annotate dialog from the <link linkend=\"browsinglogs"
#| "\">Browse log dialog</link>). In the columns before the text, you get "
#| "some information related to the latest change in each line. In the first "
#| "column the line number is displayed. In the second column you see the "
#| "name of the author and revision number. Finally, in the third column you "
#| "see the actual content of that line."
msgid ""
"In the annotate dialog, you see in a window the latest version of the "
"selected file (or the revision <quote>A</quote>version, in case you launched "
"the annotate dialog from the <link linkend=\"browsinglogs\">Browse log "
"dialog</link>). In the columns before the text, you get some information "
"related to the latest change in each line. In the first column the line "
"number is displayed. In the second column you see the name of the author and "
"revision number. Finally, in the third column you see the actual content of "
"that line."
msgstr ""
"U pribilježenom dijalogu, vidite u prozoru zadnju verziju selektovanog "
"fajla  (ili revizija &quot;A&quot; verzija, u slučaju da ste pokrenuli "
"dijalog za pribilježavanje sa <link linkend=\"browsinglogs\">Browse log "
"dialog</link>).  U kolonana prije teksta, dobijate informacije povezane sa "
"zadnjim promjenama u svakoj liniji. U prvoj koloni broj linija prikazan. U "
"drugoj koloni možete vidjeti imena autora i revizioni broj. Konačno, u "
"trećoj kolonni možete vidjeti sadržaj linija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1535
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Consequently, when a certain line appears strange to you or you assume a bug "
"there, you can immediately see who is responsible for that line. But not "
"only that, you can also find out <emphasis>why</emphasis> that line was "
"changed. To this end, move the mouse cursor over the respective revision "
"number. Then a tooltip appears that shows the log message and the date of "
"the change."
msgstr ""
"Stoga, kada se određena linija pojavi iznenada ili predpostavljate da ima "
"bug, možete automatski da vidite ko je odgovoran za to. Ali ne samo to, "
"možete također pronaći <emphasis>zašto</emphasis> da je linija promjenjena. "
"Do kraja ovog, pomijerajte kursor miša iznad revizionog broja. Onda alatni "
"savjet će se pojaviti i pokazati log poruku i datum promjene."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1548
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browsing &CVS; Logs"
msgstr "Pogledati  &CVS; Logs"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you mark one file in the main view and choose <guimenuitem>Browse Log..."
"</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu or right click the "
"marked file and choose <guimenuitem>Browse Log...</guimenuitem> from the "
"context menu, the <guilabel>CVS Log</guilabel> dialog is shown (if you mark "
"more than one, nothing happens, as &cervisia; can only generate and parse "
"the log for one file at a time). This dialog offers functionality that is "
"beyond viewing the file's history. Using it as a version browser you can:"
msgstr ""
"Kada označite jedan fajl u glavnom pregledu i birajte  <guimenuitem>Traženje "
"Log...</guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> izbornik ili desni klik "
"na označeni fajl ili izaberite <guimenuitem>Traženje Log...</guimenuitem> iz "
"kontekstnog izornika,  <guilabel>CVS Log</guilabel> dijalog je prikazan (ako "
"označite više od jednog, ništa se neće desiti, &cervisia;  može samo "
"generisati i raščlaniti log za jedan fajl). Ovaj dijalog nudi funkcionalnost "
"koja je iznad pregleda fajlova kroz historiju. Koristeći ove verzije "
"traženja možete:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1563
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"View the revision, author, date, branch, commit message, and tags for each "
"version of the marked file."
msgstr ""
"Pregled revizije, autora, datuma, branch, poruka, i oznaka za svaku verziju "
"u označenom fajlu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1568
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"View a graphical tree representation showing the branching and tagging of "
"the marked file."
msgstr "Pregled grafičkog prikaza grananja i označivanja označenih fajlova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1573
#, no-c-format
msgid "View any version of the marked file (with the default application)."
msgstr "Pregled billo koje verzije označenih fajlova (sa default aplikacije)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1577
#, no-c-format
msgid "Watch an annotated view of any version of the marked file"
msgstr "Pregledaj bilješke od bilo koje verzije označenih fajlova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1581
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"View the differences between any pair of versions of the marked file, "
"including pairs with the current working copy version of the marked file."
msgstr ""
"Pregledajte razlike između bilo kojeg para označenih fajlova, uključujuči "
"parove sa radnom kopijom verzije koja je označena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1586
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create patches containing the differences between any pair of versions of "
"the marked file, including pairs with the current working copy version of "
"the marked file."
msgstr ""
"Kreirajte pute koji sadrže različitosti između parova označenih verzija "
"fajlova, uključujuči parove uključujući radne kopije verzije označenog fajla."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1594
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s browse logs dialog</title>"
msgstr "<title>A slika ekrana&cervisia;'s pretraživanje logs dijaloga</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1597
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s browse logs dialog</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>A slika ekrana&cervisia;'s pretraživanje logs dijaloga</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1601
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose to see the history as provided by the <command>cvs log</"
"command> command (<guilabel>CVS Output</guilabel>), as a <guilabel>Tree</"
"guilabel>, or in <guilabel>List</guilabel> form. What you prefer is of "
"course a matter of taste and it depends on what information you are "
"interested in. The tree is an intuitive representation of what has been done "
"on different branches by which authors. As tooltips, you can see the "
"corresponding log messages. The list is by its nature linear and, therefore, "
"does not give an immediate view of branches; on the other hand, it "
"concentrates more otherwise relevant information on less screen estate, "
"namely the time of each change of the file and the first part of the log "
"message. The &CVS; output information is complete, but long, and difficult "
"to read. To alleviate these problems, you have the ability to search the "
"text of the &CVS; output, by pressing the <guibutton>Find...</guibutton> "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Možete koristiti pregled historije kroz <command>cvs log</command> komanda "
"(<guilabel>CVS Output</guilabel>), kao <guilabel>Drvo</guilabel> ili u  "
"<guilabel>Listi</guilabel> forma. Ono što preferirate je stvar ukusa i "
"zavisi od informacije za koju ste zainteresovani. Drvo je intuitivni prikaz "
"onog šta je urađeno na različitim granama od više autora. Kao alatni "
"savjeti, možete vidjeti korespondirajuće log poruke. Ova lista je linearna, "
"zbog tog, ne daje automatski pregled grana; u drugu ruku, koncentrira više "
"drugih relevantnih informacija na manjem dijelu ekrana, naime  veijeme za "
"promjenu u svakom fajlu i prvom dijelu log poruke. &CVS; output informacija "
"je kompletna, ali duga, i teška za pročitati. Za ublžavanje ovih problema, "
"imate sposobnost pretraživanja teksta od &CVS; output, pritiskanjem  "
"<guibutton>Nađi...</guibutton> dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1617
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To obtain more information about a certain revision, you can click on it "
#| "either in the list or the tree view. The fields in the middle of the "
#| "dialog are then filled with the complete information provided by "
#| "<command>cvs log</command>. You can mark two revisions, called &quot;"
#| "A&quot; and &quot;B&quot;, which are relevant if you make use of further "
#| "features provided by the buttons. Revision &quot;A&quot; can be chosen "
#| "with the left mouse button, revision &quot;B&quot; with the middle one. "
#| "In the list view, you can also navigate with your cursor keys. In order "
#| "to mark revisions &quot;A&quot; and &quot;B&quot;, use the shortcuts "
#| "<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>, <keycombo "
#| "action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>B</keycap></keycombo>, respectively. Using "
#| "the <guilabel>CVS Output</guilabel> view, you can click on the "
#| "<guilabel>Select for revision A</guilabel> and <guilabel>Select for "
#| "revision B</guilabel> to mark the revisions."
msgid ""
"To obtain more information about a certain revision, you can click on it "
"either in the list or the tree view. The fields in the middle of the dialog "
"are then filled with the complete information provided by <command>cvs log</"
"command>. You can mark two revisions, called <quote>A</quote>and <quote>B</"
"quote>, which are relevant if you make use of further features provided by "
"the buttons. Revision <quote>A</quote>can be chosen with the left mouse "
"button, revision <quote>B</quote> with the middle one. In the list view, you "
"can also navigate with your cursor keys. In order to mark revisions "
"<quote>A</quote>and <quote>B</quote>, use the shortcuts <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>, <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>B</keycap></keycombo>, respectively. Using the "
"<guilabel>CVS Output</guilabel> view, you can click on the <guilabel>Select "
"for revision A</guilabel> and <guilabel>Select for revision B</guilabel> to "
"mark the revisions."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dobili više informacija o određenoj reviziji, možete kliknuti na "
"listu ili drvo za pregled. Polja u sredini dijaloga su popunjena sa "
"kompletnim informacijama postavljenim od  <command>cvs log</command>. Možete "
"označiti dvije revizije, nazvane  &quot;A&quot; and &quot;B&quot;, koje su "
"relevantne ako imate koristi od dugmadi. Revizija  &quot;A&quot; može biti "
"izabrana lijevom tipkom na mišu, revizija  &quot;B&quot; sa jednim srednjim. "
"Na pregledu liste, možete također navigirati sa kursorkim tipkama. U smislu "
"da označite reviziju s &quot;A&quot; i &quot;B&quot;, koristite kratice  "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>, <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>B</keycap></keycombo>,odnosno. Koristeći "
"<guilabel>CVS Output</guilabel> pregled, možete kliknuti na <guilabel> "
"Selektuj za reviziju A</guilabel> i <guilabel>Selektuj za reviziju  B</"
"guilabel> da označite reviziju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1633
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you press the <guibutton>Annotate</guibutton> button, you get a dialog "
#| "showing the text of file belonging to the revision marked as &quot;"
#| "A&quot;. Every line is prefixed with the information about who edited "
#| "this last time, and at which revision this happened. You can get more "
#| "information about viewing annotated versions in <xref linkend=\"annotate"
#| "\"/>."
msgid ""
"If you press the <guibutton>Annotate</guibutton> button, you get a dialog "
"showing the text of file belonging to the revision marked as <quote>A</"
"quote>. Every line is prefixed with the information about who edited this "
"last time, and at which revision this happened. You can get more information "
"about viewing annotated versions in <xref linkend=\"annotate\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ako pritisnete <guibutton>Pribilježiti</guibutton>dugme, dobijate dijalog "
"koji prikazuje tekst fajl koji pripada označenoj reviziji kao  &quot;"
"A&quot;.   Svaka linija je prefiksovana sa informacijom koje uređivao zadnji "
"put, i koja revizija se desila. Možete dobiti više informacija oko pregleda "
"pribilježavanjem verzije u <xref linkend=\"annotate\"/>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1641
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you press the <guibutton>Diff</guibutton> button, a <command>cvs diff</"
#| "command> call is issued and you get a dialog in which all the "
#| "modifications between the two marked revisions are shown. If you mark "
#| "revision &quot;A&quot;, but not revision &quot;B&quot;, &cervisia; will "
#| "generate the modifications between the file version marked as revision "
#| "&quot;A&quot; and the working copy version of the file. This allows you "
#| "to view the differences between your version of the file and any version "
#| "available in &CVS;. To make it easy to see the changes, different colors "
#| "are used to mark lines which have been added, removed or simply changed. "
#| "You can get more information about viewing differences in <xref linkend="
#| "\"diff\"/>."
msgid ""
"If you press the <guibutton>Diff</guibutton> button, a <command>cvs diff</"
"command> call is issued and you get a dialog in which all the modifications "
"between the two marked revisions are shown. If you mark revision <quote>A</"
"quote>, but not revision <quote>B</quote>, &cervisia; will generate the "
"modifications between the file version marked as revision <quote>A</"
"quote>and the working copy version of the file. This allows you to view the "
"differences between your version of the file and any version available in "
"&CVS;. To make it easy to see the changes, different colors are used to mark "
"lines which have been added, removed or simply changed. You can get more "
"information about viewing differences in <xref linkend=\"diff\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ako pritisnete <guibutton>Diff</guibutton> dugme, <command>cvs diff</"
"command>i dobit ćete dijalog u kojem su sve modifikacije između dvije "
"označene ravizije. Ako označite reviziju  &quot;A&quot;, ali ne reviziju  "
"&quot;B&quot;, &cervisia; će generirati modifikacije između verzija fajlova "
"koji su označeni kao revizija n &quot;A&quot; i radnu kopiju verzije fajla. "
"Ovo vam dozvoljava da vidite razlike između vaše verzije fajla i dostupne "
"verzije u &CVS;. Da bi učinili da je lakše vidjet razlike, koristite "
"različite boje da označite linije koje su dodane, uklonjenje ili samo "
"izmjenjene. Možete dobiti više informacija o razlici izgleda u <xref linkend="
"\"diff\"/>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1654
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you press the <guibutton>Create Patch...</guibutton> button, you get a "
#| "dialog in which you can set the format options for generating a file "
#| "containing all the modifications between the two marked revisions which "
#| "are shown. If you mark revision &quot;A&quot;, but not revision &quot;"
#| "B&quot;, &cervisia; will generate the modifications between the file "
#| "version marked as revision &quot;A&quot; and the working copy version of "
#| "the file. This allows you to generate a patch, or difference file, "
#| "between your version of the file and any version available in &CVS;. "
#| "After configuring the format of the patch in the dialog, and pressing "
#| "<guibutton>OK</guibutton>, a <command>cvs diff</command> command is "
#| "issued to generate the difference file. A <guilabel>Save As</guilabel> "
#| "dialog will pop up. Enter the file name and location of the patch file "
#| "&cervisia; generated, in order to save it. You can get more information "
#| "about creating patches, and the patch format options in <xref linkend="
#| "\"creatingpatches\"/>."
msgid ""
"If you press the <guibutton>Create Patch...</guibutton> button, you get a "
"dialog in which you can set the format options for generating a file "
"containing all the modifications between the two marked revisions which are "
"shown. If you mark revision <quote>A</quote>, but not revision <quote>B</"
"quote>, &cervisia; will generate the modifications between the file version "
"marked as revision <quote>A</quote>and the working copy version of the file. "
"This allows you to generate a patch, or difference file, between your "
"version of the file and any version available in &CVS;. After configuring "
"the format of the patch in the dialog, and pressing <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>, a <command>cvs diff</command> command is issued to generate the "
"difference file. A <guilabel>Save As</guilabel> dialog will pop up. Enter "
"the file name and location of the patch file &cervisia; generated, in order "
"to save it. You can get more information about creating patches, and the "
"patch format options in <xref linkend=\"creatingpatches\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ako pritisnete <guibutton>Kreiraj Zakrpu...</guibutton> dugme, dobit ćete "
"dijalog gdje možete postaviti format opcija za generiranje sadržinu fajla "
"svih modifikacija između dvije označene revizije koje su prikazane. Ako "
"označite reviziju &quot;A&quot;, ali ne reviziju  &quot;B&quot;, &cervisia; "
"će generistati modifikacije između verzije fajla označene kao revizije &quot;"
"A&quot; i radne verzije fajla. ovo vam dozvoljava da generišete zakrpu, ili "
"drugačiji fajl, između svoje verzije i verzije dostupne u &CVS; Nakon "
"konfiguracije formata zakrpe u dijalogu, i pritiskanja <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>, a <command>cvs diff</command> komanda je izdata da generiše "
"razlike fajlova. <guilabel>Sačuvaj kao</guilabel> dijalog će iskočiti. "
"Unesite ime fajla i lokaciju zakrpe fajla &cervisia; , generisano, u smislu "
"da se sačuva. Možete dobiti više informacija o kreiranju zakrpa, i formata "
"zakrpa opcije na <xref linkend=\"creatingpatches\"/>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1670
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you press the <guibutton>View</guibutton> button, &cervisia; will "
#| "retrieve the revision marked as &quot;A&quot; and display it using the "
#| "default application for its file type."
msgid ""
"If you press the <guibutton>View</guibutton> button, &cervisia; will "
"retrieve the revision marked as <quote>A</quote>and display it using the "
"default application for its file type."
msgstr ""
"Ako pritisnete <guibutton>Pregled</guibutton> dugme,&cervisia; će povratiti "
"reviziju markiranu kao &quot;A&quot; i prikazati je koristeći default "
"aplikaciju za fajl ovog tipa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1676
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the <guibutton>Close</guibutton> button to leave the dialog and return "
"to the main view."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite <guibutton>Zatvorite</guibutton>dugme da napustite dijalog i "
"vratite se u glavni pregled."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1682
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To generate the log that is the base for the <guilabel>CVS Log</guilabel> "
"dialog, &cervisia; issues the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Da generišete ulaz koji je baza za <guilabel>CVS Log</guilabel> dijalog, "
"&cervisia; izvršava slijedeće komande:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:1689
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs log <replaceable>file name</replaceable></command>"
msgstr "<command>cvs log <replaceable>naziv fajla</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1695
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browsing the History"
msgstr "Pregled Historije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1697
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the used repository has logging enabled, &cervisia; can present you a "
"history of certain events like checkouts, commits, tags, updates and "
"releases. Choose <guimenuitem>History</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>View</"
"guimenu> menu, and &cervisia; will issue the command"
msgstr ""
"Ako već korišteno skladište ima uključen loggin &cervisia; vam može "
"predstaviti historiju pojedinig odjava, djela, oznaka, updates i otpuštanja, "
"Izaberite<guimenuitem>Historija</guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> "
"izbornik, i &cervisia; će izvršiti komandu"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:1705
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs history -e -a</command>"
msgstr "<command>cvs history -e -a</command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1708
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This fetches the complete logging file from the server, &ie; a list of the "
"events for all users and all modules. This can be a huge amount of data."
msgstr ""
"Ovo dohvaća kompletan ulaz u fajl sa servera, &ie;  lista događaja za sve "
"korisnite i sve module. Ove može biti velika količina podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1713
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you can see the list of events, sorted by date. In the second column, "
"the type of the event is shown:"
msgstr ""
"Sada možete da vidite listu događaja, sortirno po datumu. U drugoj koloni, "
"tip događaja je prikazan:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1720
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Checkout - The user who is displayed in the 'Author' column has checked out "
"a module"
msgstr "Odjava- Korisnik koji je prikazao u 'Author'kolone je provjerio modul"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1725
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tag - A user has used the command <command>cvs rtag</command>. Note that the "
"usage of <command>cvs tag</command> (as done by &cervisia;'s "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu><guimenuitem>Tag/Branch...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> command) is not recorded in the history database. "
"This has historical reasons (see the &CVS; <acronym>FAQ</acronym>)."
msgstr ""
"Oznaka- Korisnik je koristio komandu  <command>cvs rtag</command>. Imajte na "
"umu da korištenje  <command>cvs tag</command> (as done by &cervisia;'s "
"<menuchoice><guimenu> Preporučeno </guimenu><guimenuitem>Tag/Branch...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> command) nije zabilježeno u historiji poteza. Ovo "
"ima historijski razlog (see the &CVS; <acronym>FAQ</acronym>)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1733
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Release - A user has released a module. Actually, this command is rarely "
"used and not of much value."
msgstr ""
"Puštanje - Korisnik je pustio modul. U stvari, ova komanda se rijetko "
"koristi i nije od velike važnosti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1738
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Update, Deleted - A user has made an update on a file which was deleted in "
"the repository. As a consequence, the file was deleted in his working copy."
msgstr ""
"Update, Obrisano - Korisnik je učinio update na fajlu koji je obrisan iz "
"skladišta. Kao posljedica, fajl je obrisan iz njegove radne kopije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1743
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Update, Copied - A user has made an update on a file. A new version was "
"copied into working copy."
msgstr ""
"Update, Kopirano - Korisnit je učinio update na fajlu. Nova verzija je "
"kopirana u radnu verziju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1748
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Update, Merged - A user has made an update on a file. The modifications in "
"the repository version on the file were merged into his working copy."
msgstr ""
"Update, Označeno - Korisnik je učinio update na fajlu. Modifikaciju u "
"skladišnoj verziji na fajlu je označena u njegovoj radnoj kopiji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1753
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Update, Conflict - A user has made an update on a file, and a conflict with "
"his own modifications was detected."
msgstr ""
"Update, Konflikt - Korisnik je update fajl, i konflikt sa njegovim "
"modifikacijama ja primječen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1758
#, no-c-format
msgid "Commit, Modified - A user committed a modified file."
msgstr "Učiniti, Modificirati - Korisnik modificirao fajl."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1762
#, no-c-format
msgid "Commit, Added - A user added a file and committed it."
msgstr "Učiniti, Dodati - Korisnik dodao fajlove."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1766
#, no-c-format
msgid "Commit, Removed - A user removed a file and committed it."
msgstr "Učiniti, Ukloniti- Korisnik uklonio fajlove."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1773
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s history dialog</title>"
msgstr "<title>A slika ekrana &cervisia;'s historijski dijalog</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1776
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s history dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>A slika ekrana&cervisia;'s historijski dijalog</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1780
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can sort the list by other criteria simply by clicking on the respective "
"column header. In order to sort out the history entries you are interested "
"in, there are various filter options activated by check boxes:"
msgstr ""
"Možete urediti listu po drugim kriterijim jednostavno klikanjući na "
"retrospektivnu kolumnu. U interesu da sortirate historiju unosa za koju ste "
"zainteresovani, imate različite filtere aktiviranje sa check boxes:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1787
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show commit events - shows commits"
msgstr "Prikazuje uređene događaje-prikazuje urađeno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1788
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show checkout events - shows checkouts"
msgstr "Prikazuje odjavne događaje-prikazuje odjave"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1789
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show tag events - shows taggings"
msgstr "Prikazuje označene događaje-prikazuje oznake"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1790
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show other events - shows events not included in the above"
msgstr "Prikazuje druge događaje-događaje koji nisu uključeni u ovo iznad"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1791
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only user - shows only events caused by a certain user"
msgstr "Samo korisnik-prikazuje samo događaje izazvane od korisnika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1792
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only file names matching - filters file names by a regular expression"
msgstr ""
"Samo fajlovi koji odgovaraju- filtrira fajlove po rekularnoj ekspresiji"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1793
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only folders matching - filters folder names by a regular expression"
msgstr ""
"Jedini folderi koji odgovaraju-filtrira foldere po regularno ekspresiji"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1796
#, no-c-format
msgid "Special characters recognized by the regular expression matcher are:"
msgstr "Specijalno znakovi prepoznati kao regularna ekspresija znakova su:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1802
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<literal>x*</literal> matches any number of occurrences of the character "
"<literal>x</literal>."
msgstr ""
"<literal>x*</literal> odgovara bilo koje broju znakova <literal>x</literal>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1807
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<literal>x+</literal> matches one or more of occurrences of the character "
"<literal>x</literal>."
msgstr ""
"<literal>x+</literal> odgovara jednom ili više znakova <literal>x</literal>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1812
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<literal>x?</literal> matches zero or one occurrences of the character "
"<literal>x</literal>."
msgstr ""
"<literal>x?</literal> odgovara nuli ili jednom ponavljanju znaka<literal>x</"
"literal>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1817
#, no-c-format
msgid "<literal>^</literal> matches the start of the string."
msgstr "<literal>^</literal>odgovara kraju niza."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1821
#, no-c-format
msgid "<literal>$</literal> matches the end of the string."
msgstr "<literal>$</literal>odgovara kraju niza."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1825
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<literal>[a-cx-z]</literal> matches a set of characters, &eg; here the set "
"consisting of a,b,c,x,y,z."
msgstr ""
"<literal>[a-cx-z]</literal>odgovara skupu znakova , &eg;set se sastoji od  a,"
"b,c,x,y,z."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1838
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Usage"
msgstr "Napredno Korištenje"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1841
#, no-c-format
msgid "Updating to Tag, Branch or Date"
msgstr "Nadogradnja na oznaku, granu ili datum"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1843
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Branches of a module are parallel versions of this module. A good real "
#| "life example of the use of this feature is the release of a software "
#| "project. After a major release, there are bugs in the code that should be "
#| "fixed, but people want to add new features to the application too. It is "
#| "very hard to do both at the same time because new features usually "
#| "introduce new bugs, making it hard to track down the old ones. To solve "
#| "this dilemma, &CVS; lets you create a parallel version, that we will call "
#| "the &quot;stable release branch&quot;, where you can only add bugfixes, "
#| "leaving the main branch (HEAD) open for adding new features."
msgid ""
"Branches of a module are parallel versions of this module. A good real life "
"example of the use of this feature is the release of a software project. "
"After a major release, there are bugs in the code that should be fixed, but "
"people want to add new features to the application too. It is very hard to "
"do both at the same time because new features usually introduce new bugs, "
"making it hard to track down the old ones. To solve this dilemma, &CVS; lets "
"you create a parallel version, that we will call the <quote>stable release "
"branch</quote>, where you can only add bugfixes, leaving the main branch "
"(HEAD) open for adding new features."
msgstr ""
"Branches modula su paralelne verzije ovog modula. Dobar životni primjer ovog "
"korištenja je realizacija sofrverskog projekta. Nakon glavnog puštanja, "
"postoje bugovi u kodu koji trebaju biti popravljeni, ali ljudi žele dodati "
"nove karakteristike u aplikaciju. Jako je teško uraditi oboje u isto vrijeme "
"jer nove karakteristike obično nose i nove bugove sa sobom, čini da je teško "
"pratiti stare. Da bi riješili ovu dilemu &CVS;  vam dozvoljava kreiranje "
"paralelne verzije, koja će se zvati &quot; stabilno puštanje branch &quot;, "
"gdje možete dodati samo popravljanje bugova, ostavljajuči glavni branch  "
"(HEAD) otvorenu za dodavanje novih karakteristika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1854
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tags are used to mark a version of a project. &CVS; stamps one version of "
"each file with the tag, so when you checkout or update to a specific tag, "
"you will get always the same file versions; therefore, as opposed to "
"branches, tags are not dynamic: you cannot develop a tag. Tags are useful to "
"mark releases, big changes in the code, &etc;"
msgstr ""
"Oznake se koriste da se označi verzija projekta. &CVS; pečati jedne verzije "
"svakog fajla sa oznakama, tako da kad provjerite za update za specifičnu "
"oznaku, uvijek ćete dobiti istu verziju fajla; zbog tog, suprotno od "
"branches, oznake nisu dinamične: ne možete razviti oznaku. Oznake su korisne "
"za oslobađanje, veliki promjena u kodu,&etc;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1862
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are developing or following the development of a software project, "
"you do not necessarily work with the main branch all the time. After a "
"release, you may want to stay with the released branch for a while, to enjoy "
"its relative stability, fix bugs, translate the sources, &etc; To do all "
"that, you have to update to the released branch. All your files will be "
"updated to the latest version of the files in that branch. After updating, "
"all your new commits will be uploaded to the new branch as well."
msgstr ""
"Kada razvijate ili pratite razvijanje softverskog projekta, ne morate raditi "
"sa glavnim branc svo vrijeme. Nakon puštanja, možda želite ostati sa "
"puštenim branch neko vrijeme, da uživate u relativnoj stabilnosti, "
"popravljate bug, prevodite izvor, &etc; Da biste radili sve to, morate "
"uradite update puštenog branch. Svi vaši fajlovi će biti update zadnje "
"verzije fajlova u branch. Nakon update, sve novo što ste uradili će biti "
"update na novi branch također."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1872
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Also, if you want to track a bug that was reported against a past tagged "
"release, &CVS; offers you the possibility to retrieve the software as it was "
"released, by updating to that tag. Besides, if you want to fetch a past "
"version of your project, you can update your working copy to a specific "
"date. This may be useful if an error was introduced in the project between "
"two releases, and you have an opinion on when that was. When you update to a "
"date or tag, the versions of your files will be the same as the versions in "
"that specific date or the versions stamped by that tag."
msgstr ""
"Također, ako želite da pratite bug koji je prijavljen nakon što je zadnja "
"oznaka puštena, &CVS; vam nudi mogućnosti povratna na softver kad je pušten, "
"update do te oznake. Pored tog, ako želite da donijete prošlu verziju vašeg "
"projekta, možete update vašu radnu kopiju na određeni datum. Ovo može biti "
"korisno ako se pojavi greška na projektu između dva puštanja, i imate "
"mišljenje kad se to moglo desiti. Kada izvršite update do datuma ili oznake, "
"verzija vaših fajlova će biti ista kao verzija na specifikovani datum ili "
"verzija opečečena oznakom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1883
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before updating to a different branch or tag, make sure you committed all "
"your changes to the branch you are working with. If your are not ready to "
"commit your changes, but do not want to discard them, do not update to the "
"new branch, as you may lose your changes. As an alternative, you can do a "
"new <link linkend=\"checkingout\">checkout</link>, to work in parallel with "
"both versions."
msgstr ""
"Prije update do različitog branch oznake, budite sigurni da ste uradili sve "
"pormjene na branch na kojima radite. Ako niste spremni da napravite "
"promjene, ali ih ne želite odbaciti, ne radite novi update na branch, jer "
"možete izgubiti promjene. Kao alternativa, možete napraviti novi <link "
"linkend=\"checkingout\">checkout</link>, da radite paralelno na obje verzije."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1893
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s update to tag dialog</title>"
msgstr ""
"<title>slika ekrana od  &cervisia; dijaloga za nadogradnju na oznaku</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1896
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A screenshot of &cervisia;'s update to tag dialog</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>slika ekrana od  &cervisia; dijaloga za nadogradnju na oznaku</"
"phrase>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1902
#, no-c-format
msgid "Update to branch"
msgstr "Nadogradnja na granu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1903
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option to update to a branch. Enter the name of the branch in "
"the drop down text box (or press the <guilabel>Fetch List</guilabel> button "
"to retrieve the list of branches from the &CVS; server, and select the one "
"you want in the drop down list)."
msgstr ""
"Selektovanjem ove opcije update branch. Unesite ime branch u tekst kutiju "
"( ili pritisnite  <guilabel>Fetch List</guilabel> dugme za pregled liste "
"branc iz the &CVS; servera, i selektujte onu koju želite ubaciti na listu)."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1912
#, no-c-format
msgid "Update to tag"
msgstr "Update to tag"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1913
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option to update to a tag. Enter the name of the tag in the drop "
"down text box (or press the <guilabel>Fetch List</guilabel> button to "
"retrieve the list of tags from the &CVS; server, and select the one you want "
"in the drop down list)."
msgstr ""
"Selektujte ovu opciju da update oznaku. Unesite ime oznake u tekst kutiju "
"(ili pritisnite <guilabel>Fetch List</guilabel> dugme za pregled liste "
"oznaka sa &CVS; servera, i selektujte onu koju želite ubaciti na listu)."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1922
#, no-c-format
msgid "Update to date"
msgstr "Update to date"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1923
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option to update to a date. In the field below, you can enter a "
"wide variety of date formats. One possible format is <literal>yyyy-mm-dd</"
"literal> where <literal>yyyy</literal> is the year, <literal>mm</literal> is "
"the month (numerically) and <literal>dd</literal> is the day. Alternatives "
"are some English phrases like <literal>yesterday</literal> or <literal>2 "
"weeks ago</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Selektovanjem ove opcije za update datuma. U polju ispod, možete unijeti "
"više varijaniti formata datuma. Jedan mogući format je <literal>yyyy-mm-dd</"
"literal> gdje<literal>yyyy</literal> je godina, <literal>mm</literal> je "
"mjesec (brojčano) i <literal>dd</literal> je dan. Alternative su neke "
"Engleske fraze kao <literal>jučer</literal> or <literal>prije 2 sedmice</"
"literal>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1935
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Updating to a tag or date make them 'sticky', &ie; you cannot commit further "
"modifications on that files (unless the tag is a branch tag). In order to "
"get back to the main branch, use the menu item "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu><guimenuitem>Update to HEAD</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Nadogradnja do oznake ili datuma čini ih ljepljivim , &ie; i ne možete "
"raditi dalje modifikacije na tim fajlovima (osim ako oznaka nije branch "
"oznaka). Da bi se vratili do glavnog brancha, koristite stavke iz izbornika "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Napredno</guimenu><guimenuitem>Nadogradnja na HEAD</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1943
#, no-c-format
msgid "The command issued to update to a branch or tag is:"
msgstr "Izdana naredba za ažuriranje grane i taga je:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:1945
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs update -r <replaceable>tag</replaceable></command>"
msgstr "<command>cvs update -r <replaceable>tag</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1948
#, no-c-format
msgid "The command issued to update to a date is:"
msgstr "Izdana naredba za update je:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:1950
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs update -D <replaceable>date</replaceable></command>"
msgstr "<command>cvs update -D <replaceable>date</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1953
#, no-c-format
msgid "The command issued to update to the main branch (HEAD) is:"
msgstr "Izdana komanda za glavni branch (HEAD) je:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:1955
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs update <option>-A</option></command>"
msgstr "<command>cvs update <option>-A</option></command>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1962
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tagging and Branching"
msgstr "Tagging and Branching"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1964
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We discuss here only the technical aspects of tagging and branching. If you "
"are only a <emphasis>user</emphasis>, not the administrator of the "
"repository, you will probably not be confronted with the problem. If however "
"you are your own administrator, you should first read about the non-"
"technical problems that accompany branching, in order to get an impression "
"of how time-consuming and error-prone maintaining different branches of a "
"project can be. The appendix includes some references about this topic."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje diskutujemo jedino o tehničkim aspektima oznaka i grananja. Ako ste "
"jedini <emphasis>korisnik</emphasis>, ne administrator skladišta, vjerovatno "
"nećete biti suoćeni sa problemima. Ako ste sami svoj administrator, trebali "
"biste prvo pročitati ne-tehničke probleme koji prate granjanja, u smislu da "
"dobiju impresiju kako vrijeme i problemi-skloni održavanju različitih "
"grananja mogu biti. Dodatak uključuje neke reference o ovoj temi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1974
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simple tagging is something you usually do when a release is made, so that "
"you can at any time easily get back to the project state at that time. Tags "
"are usually given a name consisting of the project name and the version "
"number. For example, &cervisia; 1.0 is available under the tag "
"<literal>CERVISIA_1_0</literal>. &cervisia; enforces &CVS;'s strict rules "
"about what constitutes valid tag name. It must begin with a letter and may "
"contain letters, digits, hyphens and underscores."
msgstr ""
"Jednostavne oznake su nešto što vjerovatno radite  kad je izdanje, tako da u "
"svako vrijeme možete da se vratite na projekat. Oznakama su uobičajeno data "
"imena koja su sastavljena od postojećeg imena projekta i verzije brojeva. Na "
"primjer &cervisia; 1.0  je dostupna ispod oznake <literal>CERVISIA_1_0</"
"literal>. &cervisia; čini da &CVS;' ima striktna pravila što se sastoji od "
"važećih oznaka imena. Mora početi sa slovima i može sadržavati više slova, "
"cifre, crtice i donje crtice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1984
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Normally, you will want to tag the whole project (although &CVS; of course "
"allows you to tag only a subset). To this end, mark the toplevel folder in "
"the view and choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu><guimenuitem>Tag/"
"Branch</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Now enter the name of the tag, press "
"<keycap>Return</keycap> and you are done."
msgstr ""
"Normalno, željeti ćete da označite cijeli projekat (iako &CVS; naravno "
"dozvoljava oznaku samo podseta). Na kraju, označite vrhovni folder u "
"pregledu i birajte <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Oznaka/Grana </guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Sada unesite "
"ime oznake, pritisnite <keycap>Povratak</keycap> i završili ste."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1992
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Creating a branch is not significantly more difficult: In the tag dialog, "
"check the box <guibutton>Create branch with this tag</guibutton>. You can "
"also delete an existing tag: Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Delete Tag</guimenuitem></menuchoice> in the main view."
msgstr ""
"Kreiranje grane nije značajno teško: U dijalogu oznaja, označite kućicu  "
"<guibutton>Kreiraj granu sa ovom oznakom</guibutton>. Možete također da "
"izbrišete postojeću oznaku: Birajte <menuchoice><guimenu>Napredno</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Obriši Oznaku </guimenuitem></menuchoice> u glavnom "
"pregledu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2000
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another aspect of branching is the merging of modifications from a branch to "
"the current branch. If you are going to do this, choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu><guimenuitem>Merge...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. The dialog that appears now gives you two options:"
msgstr ""
"Drugi aspekt granjanja u margiranju modifikacije iz grananja do trenutnog "
"grananja. Ako ćete uraditi ovo, birajte <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Margine ...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Dijalog koji se "
"pojavljuje sad daje vam dvije opcije:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2007
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Either you may merge all modifications done on a branch to the current "
"branch. In that case, check the box <guibutton>Merge from branch</guibutton> "
"and fill in the branch you want to merge from. &cervisia; will then execute "
"the command"
msgstr ""
"Ili možete spojiti sve modifikacije na trenutnoj grani. U tom slučaju, "
"provjerite  <guibutton>Spajanje s grana</guibutton> i popunite granu sa onim "
"što želite spojiti. &cervisia;, onda će da izvrši komandu."

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:2015
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>cvs update <option>-j</option> <replaceable>branchtag</"
"replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs update <option>-j</option> <replaceable>branchtag</"
"replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2018
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The other possibility is that you want to merge only the modifications made "
"between two tags on a branch. This usually happens when you merge from the "
"same branch to the trunk several times. In that case, check the box "
"<guibutton>Merge modifications</guibutton> and enter (in the correct order) "
"the two relevant tags. This will result in a command"
msgstr ""
"Druga mogućnost je da spojite samo modifikacije između dvije oznake na "
"grani. Ovo se inače dešava kad spajate sa iste grane više puta. U tom "
"slučaju, provjerite <guibutton>Spojite modifikacije</guibutton> i unesite (u "
"sljedećem redu) dvije relevantne oznake. Ove će rezultirati komandom"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:2027
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>cvs update <option>-j</option> <replaceable>branchtag1</"
"replaceable> <option>-j</option> <replaceable>branchtag2</replaceable></"
"command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs update <option>-j</option> <replaceable>branchtag1</"
"replaceable> <option>-j</option> <replaceable>branchtag2</replaceable></"
"command>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2034
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using Watches"
msgstr "Korištenje praćenja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2036
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A watch is the conventional name for &CVS;'s feature to notify users of the "
"repository whenever a file has been changed or a developer has started "
"editing a file. The usage of watches requires that the file <filename><envar>"
"$CVSROOT</envar>/CVSROOT/notify</filename> has been set up properly. This is "
"not discussed here; if you need further information on the setup from the "
"administrator's point of view, read one of the books listed in the appendix."
msgstr ""
"Praćenje (watch) je konvencionalno ime za &CVS;'s karakteristike da "
"obavijesti korisnika o skladištenju fajla i da li je promijenjeno ili je "
"proizvođač krenuo da ga uređuje. Korištenje satova zahtijeva fajl "
"<filename><envar>$CVSROOT</envar>/CVSROOT/notify</filename> je pripremljena "
"na pravi način.  Ne diskutujemo o ovom ovdje; ako vam je potrebno više "
"informacija o postavkama administratorskog pogleda, pročitajte jednu od "
"knjiga postavljenu u dodacima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2046
#, no-c-format
msgid "&cervisia;'s main support of watches are six menu items."
msgstr "&cervisia;'s glavna podrška za satove je šesta stavka u izborniku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2050
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to add a watch to one or several files, use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add Watch...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. In the dialog you get, you can choose to get "
"notified for any of the types of events that &CVS; supports. For example, if "
"you only want to get notified when a file is committed, check the boxes "
"<guibutton>Only</guibutton> and <guibutton>Commits</guibutton>. If you want "
"to get notified about any event related to the marked files, check the box "
"<guibutton>All</guibutton>. The command line used when you accept the dialog "
"is"
msgstr ""
"Da biste dodali praćenje u jedan ili više fajlova, koristite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Napredno</guimenu><guimenuitem>Dodajte Sat...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. U dijalogu koji ste dobili, možete izabrati da "
"budete obavješteni za sve tipove događaja koji &CVS; podržava. Na primjer, "
"ako samo želite biti obavješteni kad je fajl napravljen, provjerite "
"<guibutton>Samo</guibutton> i <guibutton>Uraditi</guibutton>. Ako želite da "
"budete obaviješteni o svakoj povezanoj oznaci na fajlovima, provjerite "
"<guibutton>Sve</guibutton>. Komandna linija korištena kada prihvatite "
"dijalog je"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:2063
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>cvs watch add -a commit <replaceable>file names</replaceable></"
"command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs watch add -a commit <replaceable>naziv fajlova</replaceable></"
"command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2066
#, no-c-format
msgid "or with a similar option, depending on the events you chose to watch."
msgstr "ili slične opcije, zavisi od događaja koji izaberete da gledate."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2070
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are not interested in some files anymore, you can remove your watches "
"on them. To this end, use <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Remove Watch...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. In the "
"dialog you get here, the same options are offered as in the form you filled "
"out when adding the watch. When you confirm this dialog, &cervisia; issues "
"the command"
msgstr ""
"Ako niste zainteresovani više za neke fajlove, možete da sklonite satove sa "
"njih. Da završite, koristite  <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Uklonite Satove...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. U "
"dijalogu koji ste dobili ovdje, iste opcije su ponuđene kao u formi koju ste "
"popunili kad ste dodavali sat. Kad potvrdite dijalog , &cervisia; izdaje "
"naredbu"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:2080
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>cvs watch remove <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs uklanjanje satova<replaceable>nazivi fajlova</replaceable></"
"command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2083
#, no-c-format
msgid "possibly with an option <option>-a</option> for the chosen events."
msgstr "po mogućnossti sa opcijom<option>-a</option>za izabrani događaj."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2087
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, you can get a list of the people who are watching a couple of "
"files. Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show "
"Watchers</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Using this menu item will result in a "
"command"
msgstr ""
"Na kraju, možete dobiti listu ljudi koji prate par fajlova. Birajte  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</guimenu><guimenuitem>Prikažite Satove</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>.  Koristeći ovu stavku izbornika rezultirati će "
"komandom"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:2095
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs watchers <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs posmatraći <replaceable>nazivi fajlova</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2098
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the normal usage scenario of &CVS;, each developer works separately in "
"his checked out sandbox. When he wants to modify some file, he can just open "
"it in his editor and start working on it. Nobody else will know about this "
"work until the file gets committed."
msgstr ""
"U normalnom korištenju scenarija &CVS;, svaki član razvojnog tima radi "
"odvojeno u odvojenoj pješčanoj kutiji. Kada želite da modificirate neke "
"fajlove, on može jednostavno otvoriti uređivač i počinje da radi na tome. "
"Niko neće znati o ovom poslu dok ne bude završen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For some developer groups, this is not the preferred model of cooperation. "
"They want to get notified about someone working on a file <emphasis>as soon "
"as</emphasis> he starts with it. This can be achieved by some further &CVS; "
"commands. Before you start editing a file, select it in &cervisia;'s main "
"window and choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit "
"Files</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. This will execute the command"
msgstr ""
"Za neke proizvođačke grupe, ovo nije preferirani model kooperacije.  Oni "
"žele obavijest o radu na fajlovima  <emphasis>odmah</emphasis> kad počne. "
"Ovo može biti postignuto da karakteristikama  &CVS; komandama. Prije nego "
"počnete uređivati fajl, selektujte to u  &cervisia;'s  glavnom prozoru i "
"birajte <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</guimenu><guimenuitem>Uredi "
"fajlove</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Ovo će uraditi komanda"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:2116
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs edit <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr "<command>cvs edit <replaceable>naziv fajlova</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will send out a notification to everyone who has set an <literal>edit</"
"literal> watch on this file. It will also register you as an "
"<emphasis>editor</emphasis> of the file. You can obtain a list of all "
"editors of a certain file by using <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Editors</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. This is "
"equivalent to typing on the command line"
msgstr ""
"Ovo će poslati obavijest svima koju su postavili <literal>uredili</literal> "
"pračenje ovog fajla. Također će registrovati vas kao <emphasis>uređivać</"
"emphasis> fajlova. Možete dobiti listu svih uređivaća određenog fajla "
"koristeći <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporućeno</guimenu><guimenuitem>Prikaži "
"Urednike</guimenuitem></menuchoice>.Ovo je jednako ekvivalent komandne linije"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:2130
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs editors <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs editors <replaceable>naziv fajlova</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An editing session is automatically ended when you commit the affected file. "
"At that moment, an <literal>unedit</literal> notification gets sent out to "
"all people who have registered a respective watch on the file. Of course, "
"sometimes you may not want to commit the file, but abort the editing session "
"and revert to the previous version of the file. This is done by using "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu><guimenuitem>Unedit Files</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Note that &cervisia; will not ask you for "
"confirmation; that means if you use this menu item, all your work done since "
"you used <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit Files</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> will be lost. Precisely, &cervisia; uses the "
"command line"
msgstr ""
"Urednička sesija je automatski završena kad završite sa pogođenim fajlom. U "
"momentu,  <literal>ne uređeni</literal>  obavijest dolazi kad je poslano "
"odobama koje su registrovane da prate ovaj fajl. Naravno, ponekad možda ne "
"želite da uredite fajl, ali prekid uređivanja fajla vraća na prethodno "
"stanje. Ovo je završeno koristeći <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Neuređeni Fajlovi</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Imajte na "
"umu &cervisia; vas neće pitati za potvrdu; to znači ako koristite ovu stavku "
"izbornika, sav posao koji je urađen do sad <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Uredite Fajl</guimenuitem></menuchoice> će biti "
"izgubljen. Precizno,  &cervisia; koristi komandnu liniju"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:2147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>echo y | cvs unedit <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>echo y | cvs unedit <replaceable>naziv fajlova</replaceable></"
"command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"So far, we have only discussed the case where edits and unedits are used "
"voluntarily be the developers. In addition &CVS; supports a model which "
"<emphasis>enforces</emphasis> the usage of these commands. The responsible "
"command to switch to this model is <command>cvs watch on</command> which we "
"will not explain further because it is mostly used by the administrator of "
"the repository. However, the important point from the developer's point of "
"view is that when the project enforces edits, working copies are checked out "
"<emphasis>readonly</emphasis>. That means you cannot edit a file by default "
"(unless you use tricks like <command>chmod</command>). Only when you use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit Files</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, the file becomes writable. It is made read-only "
"again when you commit the file or use <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Unedit Files</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Do sad, samo smo diskutovali o slučajevima koji su urađeni ili ne urađeni "
"dobrovoljno od strane proizvođaća. Kao dodatak  &CVS; podržava model koji "
"<emphasis>obavezne primjene</emphasis> korištenje ovih komandi.Odgovorne "
"komande za mijenjanje u ovaj model su <command>cvs watch on</command>  koje "
"neće objašnjavati dalje jer su u većini slučajeva koriste od strane "
"administratora skladišta. Međutim, važna stvar za proizvođače je tačka "
"gledišta obaveznih primjena na uređenju projekta, radnoj kopiji su "
"provjerene <emphasis>samo za čitanje</emphasis>. To znači da ne možete "
"uređivati fajl po defaultu (osim ako koristite trikove kao <command>chmod</"
"command>). Samo kad koristite <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Uređivanje Fajlova</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, fajlovi "
"postaju pisani. Napravljeni su samo za čitanje ponovo kad uradite fajl ili "
"koristite <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ne "
"uređivanje Fajlova</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cervisia;'s editor interface helps you with projects that enforce watches "
"also in a different way. If you just started an editor with a readonly file "
"by double-clicking on it or by using <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, you would not be able "
"to save your modifications later. This has of course a reason: Whenever you "
"want to change a file, you should run <command>cvs edit</command> before, so "
"that all people watching the file get a notification that you are working on "
"it."
msgstr ""
"&cervisia;'s uredničko sučeljenje pomaže vam sa projektom koji primjenjuje "
"pratioce na drugačiji način. Ako ste tek počeli sa urednikom fajlova sa "
"dvostrukim klikom na njega ili pomoću <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Uredi</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, nećete moći sačuvati "
"vaše modifikacije kasnije. Ovo naravno ima razlog: Kad god želite da "
"promijenite fajl, trebate pokrenuti <command>cvs edit</command> prije, tako "
"da svi ljudi koji prate fajl će biti obavješteni da radite na tome."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2177
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In such a case, it is advisable to check the option "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Do cvs edit "
"Automatically When Necessary</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Now, whenever you "
"edit a file by double-clicking it, &cervisia; will run <command>cvs edit</"
"command> before the editor is actually executed. Then you can edit your file "
"as usual. When you have finished your work, commit your files, and the "
"committed files are read-only again."
msgstr ""
"U takvom slučaju, preporučljivo je provjeriti opciju  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke </guimenu><guimenuitem>Do cvs edit "
"Automatically When Necessary</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Sad, kad god "
"uređujete fajl sa duplim klikom to &cervisia; će pokrenuti <command>cvs "
"edit</command>  prije nego što je ustvari urađeno. Tako možete da uređujete "
"svoje fajlove kao inače. Kada ste završili svoj posao, uredite svoj fajl, i "
"uređeni fajlovi su za čitanje samo opet."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Locking"
msgstr "Pregled"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The development model usually followed when &CVS; is used is called "
"<emphasis>unreserved checkouts</emphasis>. Each developer has his own "
"sandbox where he can edit files as he likes. If when the watch features - "
"like <command>cvs edit</command> - are used, multiple developers can work on "
"files synchronously. Changes done by a different developer are merged into "
"the local sandbox when an update is performed."
msgstr ""
"Model razvijanja je uobičajno popračen kad je &CVS; zvao prije "
"<emphasis>unreserved checkouts</emphasis>.  Svaki proizvođač ima svoju ličnu "
"pješčanu kutiju i može da uređuje svoje fajlove kako on hoće. Ako su "
"karakteristike pratioca-kao like <command>cvs edit</command> - su korištene, "
"višestruku proizvođaći mogu raditi sinhronizovano.Promjene urađene od "
"različitih proizvođača su označeni u lokalnoj pješčanoj kutiju kad je update "
"urađen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Other revision control systems - like <acronym>RCS</acronym> and "
"<application>SourceSafe</application> use a different model. When a "
"developer wants to a edit a file, he has to <emphasis>lock</emphasis> it. "
"Only one developer at a time can a lock a file. When he has finished "
"editing, the lock is released. On the one hand, with this model, conflicts "
"can never happen. On the other hand, two developers cannot work on the same "
"file at the same time, even when their changes do not affect each other. "
"This can be a bottleneck. We are not going to discuss the organizational "
"benefits of both approaches. Nevertheless we mention that although &CVS; has "
"some support for locking, it is not the preferred way of working with &CVS;. "
"You should not use these features unless you are sure that your project "
"manager allows them."
msgstr ""
"Drugi revizioni kontrolni sistem-kao <acronym>RCS</acronym> i "
"<application>SourceSafe</application> koristi različiti model. Kada "
"proizvođač želi da uredi fajl,on mora <emphasis>zaključati</emphasis> to. "
"Samo jedan proizvođač može da zaključa fajl. Kad je završio uređivanje, "
"zaključavanje je završeno. U jednu ruku, sa ovim modelom, konflikt se nikada "
"ne može desiti. U drugu ruku, dva proizvođača ne mogu raditi na isto fajlu u "
"isto vrijeme, iako njihove promjene ne utiču jedna na drugo. Ovo može biti "
"usko grlo. Nećemo diskutovati o organizacionim benificijama u oba pristupa. "
"Ipak spomentu ćemo da&CVS; ima neku podršku za zaključavanje, to nije "
"preferirani način rada sa &CVS;.  Ne trebate koristiti ove karakteristike "
"ako niste sigurni da projekt menađer to dozvoljava."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With &cervisia;, you lock files as follows. Select the desired files in the "
"main view. Then choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Lock Files</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. This runs the "
"command"
msgstr ""
"Sa &cervisia;, zaključavate fajlove kako ide redom. Selektujte željene "
"fajlove u glavnom pregledu. Onda izaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Zaključaj Fajlove</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Ovo "
"pokreće komandu"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:2224
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs admin -l <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr "<command>cvs admin -l <replaceable>naziv fajla</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The reverse effect is achieved by using <menuchoice><guimenu>Advanced</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Unlock Files</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. This runs the "
"command"
msgstr ""
"Povratni efekt je postignut korištenjem <menuchoice><guimenu>Preporučeno</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Otključaj Fajlove</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Ovo "
"pokreće komandu"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:2232
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cvs admin -u <replaceable>file names</replaceable></command>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs admin -u <replaceable>naziv fajlova</replaceable></command>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2241
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing &cervisia;"
msgstr "Prilagođavanje &cervisia;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cervisia; can be customized in various ways to your needs and preferences. "
"Some options which you may want to change regularly are directly available "
"in the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"&cervisia; može biti uređena na više načina i preferenci. Neke opcije koje "
"ćete možda htjeti da promjenite regularno su direkto dostupne u  "
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> izbornik."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2254
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "Generalno"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2259
#, no-c-format
msgid "User name for the change log editor:"
msgstr "Korisničko ime za promjene log urednika:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whenever you use the menu item <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Insert ChangeLog Entry...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, a "
"new ChangeLog entry is generated with the current date and your username. "
"Normally, it is considered good style to insert your full name and your "
"email address into each of your ChangeLog entries. &cervisia; automatically "
"adds the full name and email address entered here."
msgstr ""
"Kad god koristite stavku iz izbornika <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Insert ChangeLog Entry...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, "
"novi ChangeLog unos je generisan sa trenutnim datumom i vašim korisničkim "
"imenom. Normalno, to podrazumijeva dobar stil za unos vašeg punog imena i "
"vaše email adresu u svaki vaš ChangeLog unos.&cervisia;  automatski dodaje "
"puno ime i email adresu ovdje."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2272
#, no-c-format
msgid "Path to CVS executable, or 'cvs':"
msgstr "Zakrpa za CVS izvršnu,  ili 'cvs':"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set the name (or path) to the <command>cvs</command> command "
"line client. By default, the &CVS; executable found in your <envar>$PATH</"
"envar> is used by &cervisia;."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete postavi ime (ili zakrpu) u <command>cvs</command> komandna "
"linija klijenta. Podrazumijevano, &CVS; izvršni program pronađe u vašem  "
"<envar>$PATH</envar> je korišten od &cervisia;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2285
#, no-c-format
msgid "Diff Viewer"
msgstr "Diff Preglednik"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2290
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of context lines in the diff dialog:"
msgstr "Broj kontekstnik linija u diff dijalogu:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2291
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For the diff dialog, &cervisia; uses the option <option>-U</option> to "
"<command>diff</command>. This lets <command>diff</command> show only a "
"limited number of lines around each difference region (context lines). Here "
"you can set the argument to <option>-U</option>."
msgstr ""
"Za diff dijalog &cervisia; koristite opciju <option>-U</option> to "
"<command>diff</command>. Ovo dozvoljava <command>diff</command> pokazuje "
"samo limitiran broj linija oko svakog različitog regiona (kontekstne "
"linije). Ovdje možete postaviti argument <option>-U</option>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2300
#, no-c-format
msgid "Additional options for cvs diff:"
msgstr "Dodatne opcije za cvs diff:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2301
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can add additional arguments to the <command>diff</command>. A "
"popular example is <option>-b</option> which lets <command>diff</command> "
"ignore changes in the amount of whitespace."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete dodati dodatne argumente u <command>diff</command>. Popularan "
"primjer je <option>-b</option>koji dozvoljava<command>diff</command> "
"ignorišite promjene u ovom količini razmaka."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2309
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tab width in diff dialog:"
msgstr "Tab width in diff dialog:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2310
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the diff dialog, tab characters present in your file or in the output of "
"the <command>diff</command> command are expanded into a fixed number of "
"space characters. By default, each tab is replaced by eight spaces, but here "
"you can setup a different number."
msgstr ""
"U diff dijalogu, tab oznaka prestavlja u vašem fajlu ili u outputo od "
"<command>diff</command> komande su proširene u prepravljen broj od znakova. "
"Po defaultu, svaki tab je sa osam mjesta, ali ovdje možete postaviti "
"različit broj."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2319
#, no-c-format
msgid "External diff frontend:"
msgstr "Vanjski  diff frontend:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2320
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you use any of the features which show the diff dialog, like "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Difference to Repository...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, &cervisia; invokes its internal diff frontend. If "
"you prefer a different one, like &kompare;, <application>TkDiff</"
"application>, or <application>xxdiff</application>, enter its file name and "
"path here."
msgstr ""
"Kada koristite bilo koju od ovih karakteristika koje su prikazane u diff "
"dijalogu, kako <menuchoice><guimenu>Pregled</guimenu><guimenuitem>Razlike u "
"Skladištenju...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, &cervisia; priziva njenu "
"unutrašnju diff frontend. Ako preferirate drugačiju, kao  &kompare;, "
"<application>TkDiff</application>, ili <application>xxdiff</application>, "
"unesite ime tog fajla ili zakrpe ovdje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2335
#, no-c-format
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2340
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When opening a sandbox from a remote repository, start a File-&gt;Status "
"command automatically"
msgstr ""
"Prilikom otvaranja pješčanika iz udaljenog skladište, počnite s File-&gt;"
"Status komandom automatski"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2342
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you check this option, the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Status</guimenuitem></menuchoice> command is started "
"whenever you open a remote sandbox. This command may need some time and also "
"needs a connection to the server for remote repositories (making it unusable "
"for offline usage)."
msgstr ""
"Kada provjerite ovu opciju<menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Status</guimenuitem></menuchoice> komanda je počela kad "
"god otvorite pješčanik. Ova komanda može trebati neko vrijeme i također "
"konekciju na server za udaljena skladišta (čineči ih ne korisnim u offline "
"načinu rada)."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2352
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When opening a sandbox from a local repository, start a File-&gt;Status "
"command automatically"
msgstr ""
"Kada otvorite pješčanik iz lokalnog skladišta, počnite File-&gt;Status "
"komandu automatski"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2354
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you check this option, the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Status</guimenuitem></menuchoice> command is started "
"whenever you open a local sandbox."
msgstr ""
"Kada provjerite ovu opciju <menuchoice><guimenu>Fajl</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Status</guimenuitem></menuchoice> komanda počinje odmah "
"kad otvorite lokalno skladište."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2366
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Preporučeno"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2371
#, no-c-format
msgid "Timeout after which a progress dialog appears (in ms):"
msgstr "Pauza nakon koje se dijalog napredka pojavljuje (in ms):"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2372
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Practically all &CVS; commands started in a sandbox which belongs to a "
"remote repository need a connection to the &CVS; server. This is affected by "
"delays from the network connection or a high load on the server. For this "
"reason, for commands like <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Difference to Repository...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"&cervisia; opens a dialog which indicates that the command is still running "
"and which allows you to abort it. Furthermore, this dialog is used to show "
"you error messages from &CVS;. As this dialog may become annoying after some "
"time, it is shown only after a certain timeout which is 4 seconds by "
"default. Here you can change this value."
msgstr ""
"Praktično sve &CVS; komande počinju u pješčaniku koji pripadaju udaljenom "
"skladištu i potrebana je konekcija za  &CVS; server.  Ovo je pogođeno "
"odgodama internetske mrže ili dugim pokretanjem servera. Iz ovog razloga, za "
"komande kao <menuchoice><guimenu>Pregled</guimenu><guimenuitem>Razlike u "
"Skladištenju...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> &cervisia; otvara dijalog koji "
"indicira da komandna lista još uvijek radi i koja vam dozvoljava da "
"prekinete to. U nastavku, ovaj dijalog se koristi da prikaže pogreške u "
"porukama  &CVS;.  Ovaj dijalog može preći u uživanje nakon nekog vremena, "
"ovo je prikazano nakog određene vremenske pauze koja je 4 sekunde po "
"defaultu. Ovdje možete promijeniti ovo trajanje."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2386
#, no-c-format
msgid "Default compression level:"
msgstr "Uobičajni nivo kompresije:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2387
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <command>cvs</command> client compresses files and patches when they are "
"transferred over a network. With the command line option <option>-z</"
"option>, the compression level can be set. You can setup &cervisia; to use "
"this option by configuring the level here. The value set here is used only "
"as a default; additionally there is a per-repository setting available in "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Repository</guimenu><guimenuitem>Repositories...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs</command>kompresuje fajlove i zakrpe kad su prenesene preko "
"mreže. Sa komandnom linijom opcija <option>-z</option>,level kompresije može "
"biti postavljen. Možete postaviti &cervisia; korištenje ove opcije "
"konfigurišući levele ovdje. Vrijednost ovdje se koristi samo po defaultu; "
"dodatno pod-skladište postavke su postavke u  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Skladište</guimenu><guimenuitem>Skladišta...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2398
#, no-c-format
msgid "Utilize a running or start a new ssh-agent process"
msgstr "Iskoristiti pokrenuti ili početi novi ssh-agent proces"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this box if you use <link linkend=\"rsh\">ext (&rsh;) repositories</"
"link>, the &ssh; remote shell to communicate with the repository and "
"<application>ssh-agent</application> to manage your keys."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite ovdje ako koristite <link linkend=\"rsh\">ext (&rsh;) "
"repositories</link>, the &ssh; udaljena školjka za komunikaciju sa "
"skladištima i <application>ssh-agent</application> da upravljate svojim "
"tipkama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2412
#, no-c-format
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Izgled"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2417
#, no-c-format
msgid "Font for Protocol Window..."
msgstr "Font for Protocol Window..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press this button to open the <guilabel>Select Font</guilabel> dialog, to "
"set the font used in the protocol window (this is the window showing the "
"output of the <command>cvs</command> client)."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite ovo dugme da otvorite <guilabel>Selektujte Font</guilabel> "
"dijalog, da postavite font korišten u protokolu prozora (ovaj prozor "
"prikazuje output od <command>cvs</command> klijent)."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2426
#, no-c-format
msgid "Font for Annotate View..."
msgstr "Pribilježeni Pregleda za Font..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2427
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press this button to open the <guilabel>Select Font</guilabel> dialog, to "
"set the font used in the <link linkend=\"annotate\">annotate view</link>."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite dugme da otvorite  <guilabel>Selektuj Font</guilabel> dijalog, da "
"postavite font koji se koristi u <link linkend=\"annotate\">annotate view</"
"link>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2434
#, no-c-format
msgid "Font for Diff View..."
msgstr "Font za Diff Pregled...."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press this button to open the <guilabel>Select Font</guilabel> dialog, to "
"set the font used in <link linkend=\"diff\">diff dialogs</link>."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite dugme da otvorite  <guilabel>Selektujte Font</guilabel> dijalog, "
"da postavite font koji se koristi  <link linkend=\"diff\">diff dialogs</"
"link>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2442
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "Boje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2443
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the colored buttons to open the <guilabel>Select Color</guilabel> "
"dialog, to set the color used for <guilabel>Conflict</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Local change</guilabel>, or <guilabel>Remote change</guilabel>, in "
"the main view or <guilabel>Diff change</guilabel>, <guilabel>Diff insertion</"
"guilabel>, or <guilabel>Diff deletion</guilabel>, in &cervisia;'s built-in "
"diff frontend."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite obojenu dugmad da otvorite  <guilabel>Selektuj Boju</guilabel> "
"dijalog, da postavite boju korištenu za <guilabel>Konflikt</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Lokalna promjena</guilabel>,ili <guilabel>Postavite promjene</"
"guilabel>, u glavnom pregledu ili <guilabel>Diff change</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Diff insertion</guilabel>, or <guilabel>Diff deletion</guilabel>, "
"in &cervisia;'s built-in diff frontend."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2453
#, no-c-format
msgid "Split main window horizontally"
msgstr "Podijelite glavni prozor horizontalno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2454
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cervisia;'s main window is normally split vertically into a window with the "
"file tree above and one with the &CVS; output below; alternatively, you can "
"arrange them horizontally."
msgstr ""
"&cervisia;'s glavni prozor je normalno podijeljen po vertikali a prozor sa "
"stablom iznad i jedan sa  &CVS; output ispod; alternativno, možete postaviti "
"temu horizontalno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2468
#, no-c-format
msgid "Appendix"
msgstr "Dodatak"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2471
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ignored Files"
msgstr "Ignorisani Fajlovi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2473
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In its main file tree, &cervisia; does not display all files which are "
"actually there. This is analog to <command>cvs</command> itself and helps to "
"avoid clutter caused by uninteresting stuff like object files. &cervisia; "
"tries to mimic <command>cvs</command>'s behavior as close as possible, &ie; "
"it gets ignore lists from the following sources:"
msgstr ""
"U glavnom stablu , &cervisia; ne prikazuje sve fajlove koji su ustvari tu. "
"To je analogno <command>cvs</command> samom sebi i pomaže u izbjegavanju "
"jurnjave izazvane neinteresantnim stvarima kao objektnim fajlovima. "
"&cervisia; pokušava da oponaša  <command>cvs</command>'s ponašanje slično "
"koliko je moguće, &ie; dobija listu ignorisanja sa slijedećeg izvora:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2483
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A static list of entries which includes things like <literal role=\"extension"
"\">*.o</literal> and <filename>core</filename>. For details, see the &CVS; "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Statična lista unosa koja uključuje stvari kao <literal role=\"extension\">*."
"o</literal> and <filename>core</filename>. Za detalje, pogledajte &CVS; "
"dokumentaciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2488
#, no-c-format
msgid "The file <filename><envar>$HOME</envar>/.cvsignore</filename>."
msgstr "Fajl<filename><envar>$HOME</envar>/.cvsignore</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2492
#, no-c-format
msgid "The environment variable <envar>$CVSIGNORE</envar>."
msgstr "Varijabla uređenja <envar>$CVSIGNORE</envar>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2495
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <filename>.cvsignore</filename> file in the respective folder."
msgstr "The <filename>.cvsignore</filename> fajl u retrospektivnom folderu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2501
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>cvs</command> itself additionally looks up entries in "
"<filename><envar>$CVSROOT</envar>/CVSROOT/cvsignore</filename>, but this is "
"a file on the server, and &cervisia; should be able to start up offline. If "
"you are working with a group that prefers to use an ignore list on the "
"server, it's probably a good idea to take a look which patterns are listed "
"there and to put them into the <filename>.cvsignore</filename> file in your "
"home folder."
msgstr ""
"<command>cvs</command> dodatno pregleda unose u <filename><envar>$CVSROOT</"
"envar>/CVSROOT/cvsignore</filename>, ali ovo je fajl na serveru, i "
"&cervisia; bi trebala raditi u offline načinu. Ako radite sa grupom koja "
"preferira korištenje ignorisane liste na serveru, vjerovatno je dobra ideja "
"pogledati koje zakrpe su izlistane ondje i staviti ih u<filename>.cvsignore</"
"filename> faju u vašem home folderu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:2515
#, no-c-format
msgid "Further Information and Support"
msgstr "Dalje Informacije i Podrška"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2519
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&CVS; comes with a complete set of documentation in the form of info "
#| "pages, known as \"The Cederqvist\". If it is properly installed, you can "
#| "browse it by typing in <userinput>info:/cvs</userinput> into the "
#| "locationbar of &konqueror;, or you can just choose "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>CVS Manual</guimenuitem></"
#| "menuchoice> in &cervisia;. An on-line &HTML; version of the Cederqvist is "
#| "available <ulink url=\"http://ximbiot.com/cvs/manual/\">on the web</"
#| "ulink>."
msgid ""
"&CVS; comes with a complete set of documentation in the form of info pages, "
"known as \"The Cederqvist\". If it is properly installed, you can browse it "
"by typing in <userinput>info:/cvs</userinput> into the locationbar of "
"&konqueror;, or you can just choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>CVS Manual</guimenuitem></menuchoice> in &cervisia;. An "
"on-line PDF version of the Cederqvist is available <ulink url=\"https://ftp."
"gnu.org/non-gnu/cvs/source/stable/1.11.21/cederqvist-1.11.21.pdf\">on the "
"web</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&CVS; dolazi sa kompletnim setom dokumentacije u formi info stranica, "
"poznate kao \"The Cederqvist\". Ako je pravilno instalirano, možete ih "
"potražiti pišući <userinput>info:/cvs</userinput> pišući u locationbar od  "
"&konqueror;,  ili možete samo izabrati <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>CVS Manual</guimenuitem></menuchoice> in &cervisia;. An "
"on-line &HTML; version of the Cederqvist is available <ulink url=\"http://"
"ximbiot.com/cvs/manual/\">on the web</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2530
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As this book is maintained together with &CVS;, it is normally the most up-"
"to-date reference; nevertheless, considering other documentation for "
"learning to use &CVS; is recommended, in particular the following."
msgstr ""
"Kako se ova knjiga održava zajendo sa  &CVS;,normalno je da večina up-to-"
"date referenci, ipak, uzima u obzir drugu dokumentaciju za učenje korištenja "
"&CVS; je preporučljivo, u djelomično pračenju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2536
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Karl Fogel has written the excellent book <ulink url=\"http://cvsbook.red-"
"bean.com/index.html\">Open Source Development with &CVS;</ulink>. About half "
"of this book is about the development process of Open Source software. The "
"other half is a technical documentation of &CVS;. Thankfully, the technical "
"part of the book has been made freely redistributable under the GPL, so that "
"you can download a &HTML; version of it. A list of errata is available on "
"the web page mentioned above."
msgstr ""
"Karl Fogel je napisao odličnu knjigu <ulink url=\"http://cvsbook.red-bean."
"com/index.html\">Open Source Development with &CVS;</ulink>. Skoro pola "
"knjige je o razvoju proces o  Open Source softveru. Druga polovica je o "
"tehničkoj dokumentaciji o &CVS;. Zahvaljujući, tehničkom dijelu knjige "
"besplatno je redistribuisana u GPL, tako da je možete uvesti sa &HTML; "
"verziji tog. Lista štamparskih greški je dostupna na web stranici pomenutoj "
"iznad."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2546
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&CVS; issues are discussed on a dedicated <ulink url=\"http://mail.gnu.org/"
"mailman/listinfo/info-cvs\">mailing list</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&CVS; pitanja se raspravljaju na <ulink url=\"http://mail.gnu.org/mailman/"
"listinfo/info-cvs\">mailing list</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2551
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is USENET group <literal>comp.software.config-mgmt</literal> dedicated "
"to configuration management in general. &CVS; is only marginally a topic in "
"this group, but nevertheless it may be interesting for discussing merits of "
"various revision control systems compared to &CVS;."
msgstr ""
"Postoji USENET groupa <literal>comp.software.config-mgmt</literal> posvečena "
"konfiguraciji menađmenta generalno. &CVS; je samo marginalno tema u ovoj "
"grupi, ali ipak može biti interesantno za diskusiju merits više varijacija "
"revizije kontrolnog sistema upoređenog sa &CVS;."

