#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3005
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens a dialog which allows you to create a new local repository. See <xref "
"linkend=\"accessing-repository\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Otvara dijalog koji dozvoljava da kreirate novu lokaciju skladištenja. "
"Pogledajte <xref linkend=\"accessing-repository\"/>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:3011
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Repository</guimenu><guimenuitem>Checkout...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Skladištenje</guimenu><guimenuitem>Odjava...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3014
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens a dialog which allows you to checkout a module from a repository. See "
"<xref linkend=\"checkingout\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Otvara dijalog koji dozvoljava odjavu modula iz skladištenja. Pogledajte "
"<xref linkend=\"checkingout\"/>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:3021
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Repository</guimenu><guimenuitem>Import...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Skladište</guimenu><guimenuitem>Uvoz...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3024
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens a dialog which allows you to import a package into the repository. See "
"<xref linkend=\"importing\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Otvara dijalog koji dozvoljava uvoz paketa u skladište. Pogledajte  <xref "
"linkend=\"importing\"/>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:3031
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Repository</guimenu><guimenuitem>Repositories...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Skladište</guimenu><guimenuitem>Skladištenja...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:3034
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Configures a list of repositories you often use and how to access them. See "
"<xref linkend=\"accessing-repository\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguriše listo skladišta koji uobičajno koristite i kako pristupiti "
